<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JDG" style="id">Thuṭhentu</book>
  <para style="h">Thuṭhentu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thuṭhentu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Thuṭhentu</para>
  <para style="mt">Thuṭhentu</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Joshua a thih hnuah Israel mi pawl in, “Kanmah lakah Kanaan mi pawl do ding in zo hrin so a feh hmaisa bik ding?” tiah Bawipa an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Judah hrin pawl an feh hmaisa bik pei. Hi ram cu an hnenah ka pe zo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cule Judah mi pawl in an unau Simeon mi pawl hnenah, “ Bawipa ih in zemmi ram ah kanmah pawl thawn hmun khatah kan feh pei ih Kanaan mi pawl cu kan do tlang pei. Cuih hnuah an lo zemmi ram ah kan feh leh pei,” tiah an sawm. Curuangah Simeon mi pawl le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Judah mi pawl cu hmun khatah ral an do tlang. Kanaan mi le Periz mi pawl tlunah nehnak Bawipa in a pek ih Israel mi in Bezek ah mi thawnghra an that.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutawkah siangpahrang Adonibezek a rak um ih an do. Kanaan mi le Periz mi pawl cu an neh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Adonibezek cu a tlan; a sinan an dawi ih an kaih hnuah a kut zungpi le a ke zungpi an tan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cutikah Adonibezek cun, “An kut zungpi le an ke zungpi tan ṭheh mi siangpahrang sawm sarih in ka cabuai hnuaiih rawl ṭilfuan an rak sar ṭheu. Atu-ah an parih ka rak tuah vekin Pathian in ka parah a tuah ve a si hi,” tiah a ti. Amah cu Jerusalem khua ah an fehpi ih cutawkah a thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cun Judah mi pawl in Jerusalem an nam ih an lak. Khawsung mi pawl an thah ṭheh hnuah an khua cu meisa in an ur.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cuih hnuah tlangpar ram, Negev ram le hmunrawn ram ih a um mi Kanaan mi pawl do dingah an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Judah mi pawl cun a hlan ih Kiriath Arba khawpi an timi Hebron khua sungih a ummi Kanaan mi pawl cu an do ih Sheshai, Ahiman, le Talmai tla an neh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cutawk ihsin Judah mi cu an feh ih a hlan ih Kiriath Sefer an rak timi Debir khua cu an do.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cule anmah lakih pakhat Kaleb in, “Kiriath Sefer a nehsuaktu cu ka fanu Aksah ka pe ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cutikah Kaleb ih naupa Kenaz ih fapa Othniel in Debir khawpi cu a neh ih curuangah Kaleb in a fanu Aksah cu a nupi ah a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A hnenih a thlen tikah a pasal Othniel cun a pa hnen ihsin lo pakhat dil dingah a fial. Curuangah a pa Kaleb hnen ahcun a feh ih a laak par ihsin a ṭum tikah a pa in, “Ziang so na poi?” tiah a rak sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cutikah a fanu Aksah cun, “Thil ka lo dil a si. Negev ram ramcaar ih i umter ruangah tikhur kan ṭul ih i zaangfah hram aw,” tiah a ti. Curuangah a pa cun saklam tikhur le thlanglam tikhur a rak pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Moses ih puzon Ken miphun ih tefa sin pawl cu Judah mi pawl thawn Ungkung Khawpi an ti mi Jerikho ihsin Judah ram Arad thlanglam ih a ummi ram caar lamah an feh ih cutawk ahcun Amalek mi pawl lakah an vung um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cule Judah mi pawl cu Simeon mi pawl thawn an feh ih Zefath khua ih um Kanaan mi pawl an neh ih an that thluh. Cuih khua cu an camsiat ih an siatsuah; cule Hormah tiah hmin an sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cun Gaza khua, Ashkelon khua, le Ekron khua pawl cu an ukmi ram ciar thawn an lak ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Judah mi pawl cu Bawipa in a bawm ruangah tlangpar ram khal an lak thluh. Asinain tipikap hmunrawn ih a ummi pawl cu thir rangleng tla an neih ruangah an neh thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Moses ih thu a rak pekmi vekin Hebron cu Kaleb hnenah pek a si. Cule Kaleb in Anak ih fapa pathum pawl cu Hebron ihsin a dawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Asinain Benjamin hrin pawl cun Jerusalem ih a ummi Jebus mi pawl cu an dawi suak lo. Curuangah Jebus mi pawl le Benjamin hrin pawl cu Jerusalem ah tuih san tiangin an um tlang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Josef hrin Efraim le Manasseh phun pawl in Luz ti ih an rak kawh mi Bethel khawpi an va do. An hnenah Bawipa cu a um. Bethel khawpi ahcun mi thlingthlatu pawl an thlah ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />khawsung ihsin mi pakhat a ra suakmi an hmu ih a hnenah, “Hi khawpi sungih luh theinak in sim hnik aw; zianghman kan lo ti lo ding,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cutiin a sim hai ih cupa le a innsang zate siar lo Josef hrin pawl cun Bethel khawsung mi hmuahhmuah cu an that ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cupa cu Hit mi pawl ih ramah a feh ih khawpi pakhat a sak ih Luz tiah hmin a sak. Tuih san tiangin a cuih khua hmin cu Luz a si lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Manasseh hrin pawl cun Beth Shan khua, Taanak khua, Dor khua, Ibleam khua, Megiddo khua pawl le an kiangkap khawte pawl sung um Kanaan mi pawl cu an dawi suak lo. Atu tiangin acuih khua ahcun an um lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Israel mi pawl an hung cah deuhdeuh tikah Kanaan mi pawl cu hranhram in hna an ṭuanter; a sinan a dawi cu an dawi suak thluh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Efraim hrin pawl in Gezer khawpi ih a ummi Kanaan mi pawl cu an dawisuak thluh lo ruangah tuihsun tiangin cutawk ah an um lai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Zebulun hrin pawl in Kitron le Nahalol khawpi ih um Kanaan mi pawl cu an dawi suak thluh lo hrangah cutawk ahcun tuihsun tiangin an um lai. Zebulun hrin pawl in hranhram in anmah riantu ah an canter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Asher hrin pawl in Akko khua, Sidon khua, Ahlab khua, Akzib khua, Helbah khua, Afek khua, le Rehob khawpi pawl ih a um a ummi Kanaan mi pawl cu an dawi suak thluh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cutiih an dawisuak thluh lo ruangah cutawk ahcun Asher mi le Kanaan mi pawl cu an um tlang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Naftali hrin pawl in Beth Shemesh le Beth Anah khawpi ih a ummi Kanaan mi pawl an dawi suak thluh lo ruangah hmun khat ah an um tlang. Asinain Kanaan mi pawl cu Naftali hrin pawl in hranhram in anmah riantu ah an canter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Amor mi pawl in Dan hrin pawl cu tlangpar ram ah an dawi ih hmunrawn ram ih ṭum an kham.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Cule Amor mi pawl cu Heres Tlang, Aijalon le Shaalbim ah an um thotho; asinain Josef hrin Efraim le Manasseh tesinfa pawl in an uk hai ih hranhram in an hna an ṭuanter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Amor mi pawl ih ramri cu Akrabbim Tlangkawn ihsin Sela in saklampi tiang a hung thleng.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa ih vancungmi cu Gilgal ihsin Bokhim ah a feh ih Israel mi hnenah, “Izipt ram ihsin ka lo suahter ih nan pupa hnenih ka tiamkammi ramah ka lo thlenpi. Nan hnenih ka thukamnak cu ka bal lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />‘Nannih khal in hi ramih a ummi miphun dang pawl thawn thukamnak nan tuah ve lo pei ih an biakṭheng pawl cu nan bal thluh sawn pei,’ tiah ka lo ti zo kha! Asinain ka lo ti vekin nan tuah dah lo. Nan tuah sawn mi hi zohhnik uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Curuangah fiangtein ka lo sim: hmaiih nan nor tikah himi pawl cu ka dawi lo ding. Nan ral an si dingih nan hrangah an khawzing pawl cu a lo awktu thang an si ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cutiih vancungmi ih simmi an theih tikah Israel pawl cu napi in an ṭap ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Curuangah cuih hmun cu Bokhim tiah an ko. Cule Bawipa hnen ah cutawkah cun thawinak an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Joshua in Israel mi pawl cu an comi ram ciarah a tlunter hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Joshua ih nun sung hmuahhmuah le a thih hnu tiang khalah Bawipa ih thiltuahmi a theitu upa pawl an nun sung cu Israel mi pawl in Bawipa an bia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nun ih fapa Joshua, Bawipa ih salpa cu kum za le kum hra a ti ah a thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amah cu Gaash tlang ihsin saklam, Efraim tlangram ih a ummi amah ih ram sungah Timnath Heres ah an phum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cule cuih san ih Israel mi pawl cu an thi ih cuih hnu ih a hung suakmi san thar cun Bawipa siseh, Bawipa in Israel hrangih a tuahmi hmuahhmuah siseh, an thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa ih hmaiah Israel mi cu an sual ih Baal khawzing pawl an biak sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An pupa pawl ih Pathian, Izipt ram ihsin anmah a hruai suaktu Bawipa kha bia nawn loin an kiangkap pawl ih khawzing tla biak an thok. Cuih khawzing hmaiah an kun ih Bawipa a thin an hengter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa an tlansan ih Baal khawzing le Ashtarte khawzing pawl sawn an biak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Curuangah Israel parah Bawipa cu a thin a heng ngaingai ih damiah le rukru pawl ih rukmi le rammi ah a canter. An kiangkap ih an ral pawl in an nor vivo ih Israel pawl cu anmah le anmah hman an hum-aw thei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A rak sim cia zo vekin raldo ih an feh tinte in Bawipa in a hnong hai a si. Curuangah Israel mi cu an van a saang ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cule mi ramtu damiah pawl ih kut ihsin an himnak dingah Israel mi hnenah Bawipa in thuṭhentu pawl a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sikhalsehla hi thuṭhentu pawl ih thu khal an ngai cuang lo. Bawipa ih hrangah cun hlawhhlang vek an si ih khawzing dang pawl an biak. An pupa pawl cun Bawipa ih thupekmi an thlun naón ahi santhar minung pawl cun an thlun nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />An hrangih hotu a pekmi an nun sung cu Bawipa in a bawm ih an ral kut ihsin a luatter ringring hai ṭheu. Ziangahtile an ral pawl hremnak ruangih an aihramnak kha Bawipa in a theih tikah a zaangfah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Asinain an hotu a thih vete cun Israel mi pawl cu an nuncan hlun keel ah an kirsal ih a hlan hnakin an luar sawn. Khawzing dangdang an thlun ih an hmaiah an kun ih an biak. Cutiih an nuncan siava cu thlah siang hrimhrim loin an thlun fetfet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Curuangah Bawipa cu Israel mi tlunah a thin a heng ngaingai ih, “An thlun hrimhrim dingah an pupa hnenih ka thukam cu hi miphun in an bal ṭheh zo a si. Cutiih ka thu an thlun lo ruangah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Joshua in a thih zawng ih a taanta mi miphun dang pawl cu ka dawisuak lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />An pupa pawl in ka thu an thlun vekin hi Israel mi pawl hin ka thu an thlun maw thlun lo ding ti zoh-nakah hi miphun dang pawl ka hmang ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Curuangah acuih miphun dang pawl tla cu Bawipa in Joshua kut sungah a pe lo; zamrang khal in dawi loin cutawk ih a umternak a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kanaan ram sungih ral a do hrih lomi Israel mi pawl hniksaknak ah hi ram sungah Bawipa in miphun dang malte a taanter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel mi pawl hrek khat raldo hi ziangvek a si ti a thei hrih lo pawl in raldo an zirnak le an theihnak dingah a taanter hrimmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kanaan ram sungah a taangmi pawl cu: Filistin khawpi panga, an zatein Kanaan mi, Sidon mi, le Baal Hermon Tlang ihsin Hamath Tlangkawn tiang Lebanon Tlangih a ummi Hiv mi pawl an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa in an pupa pawl hnenah Moses hmangin a thupek kha Israel mi pawl ih an thlun le thlun lo theih hliahnak ah cuih miphun dang pawl cu a umter hrim a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Curuangah Israel mi pawl cun Kanaan mi, Hit mi, Amor mi, Periz mi, Hiv mi le Jebus mi pawl lakah umhmun an khuar ih an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nupi pasal ah nei-aw in an khawzing tla an biak ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel mi pawl in Bawipa an Pathian cu an hngilh; Bawipa ih duhlomi an tuah, an sual ih Baal khawzing le Asherah khawzing pawl an biak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Curuangah Israel mi parah Bawipa ih thinhengnak cu meisa bangin a alh ih Mesopotamia siangpahrang Kushan Rishathaim a nehter. Cuticun Israel mi pawl in Mesopotamia siangpahrang cu kum riat sung an rian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cule Israel mi pawl cu Bawipa hnenah an aihram ih Bawipa in anmah luatter dingah mi pakhat a thlah. Cupa cu Kaleb ih naupa Kenaz ih fapa Othniel a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Othniel cu Bawipa ih thlarau in a umpi ih Israel pawl hotu ah a cang. Othniel cu raldo in a feh ih Bawipa in a hnenah Mesopotamia siangpahrang va nehnak a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel ram cu kum sawmli sung ral a dai. Cule Kenaz ih fapa Othniel cu a thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Israel mi cu Bawipa ih hmaiah an sual lala. Curuangah Moab siangpahrang Eglon cu Bawipa in Israel hnakin a cakter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cule Eglon cun Ammon mi le Amalek mi pawl a sawm ih Israel mi pawl an neh ih Ungkung Khawpi an ti mi Jerikho khua an lak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel mi pawl in Moab siangpahrang Eglon cu kum hleiriat sung an rian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cule Israel mi pawl cu Bawipa hnenah an au ih anmah luatter dingah mi pakhat a thlah. Amah cu Benjamin hrin sung ihsin Gera ih fapa, kehtlakpa Ehud a si. Cutikah Israel mi pawl in an siah pekmi thawn Ehud cu Moab siangpahrang Eglon hnen ahcun an thlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ehud cun kap hnih hriam ralnam pakhat, dong khat sau amah ih hrangah a tuah ih a vorhlam siir a angki fual sungah a ṭemcih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cuticun an siah cu Ehud in Eglon a va pek. Eglon cu mi thauzet a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ehud in a pek ṭheh hnuah siah a phurtu pawl cu a tlunter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Asinain amah cu Gilgal ih an phunmi lungṭelh ihsin a kir sal ih, “Maw Siangpahrang, thuthup sim ding pakhat ka lo nei a si,” a ti. Cutikah siangpahrang bawipa in a sal pawl hnenah, “Midang cu suak thluh uh,” tiah thu a pek. A ti bangtuk in an suak thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cutiin Siangpahrang bawipa cu amahte lawng a daizetmi a inn tlun colhnak khaan ih a um laiah Ehud cu a hnenah a feh ih, “Na hrangah Pathian hnen ihsin thu pakhat ka rak keng a si,” tiah a ti. Cule siangpahrang bawipa cu a ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A din laifangah Ehud cun a vorhlam siir ih a thuhmi nam cu a kehlam kut in a vun zuk ih siangpahrang bawipa ih thinhna ah a sun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A nam cu a pil thluh; a hlok tiangin a pil ih a dunglam ah a tlang suak. Cule Ehud in a phawi nawn lo ruangah a nam cu a thau in a khuh thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ehud cu lengah a suak ih sangka pawl a hren ṭheh in a tlansan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Siangpahrang bawipa ih hnen-um pawl an ra ih sangka pawl hren thluh mi an hmuh tikah siangpahrang bawipa cu inn sungah pawng a thawh lai a si pei, tiah an ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Reipi an hngak naón sangka cu a ong dah lo. Curuangah tawhfung an lak ih sangka cu an on; cutikah an bawipa cu zial parah a thi in an hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hnen-um pawl in an bawipa an hngak sungah Ehud cu a rak tlan hlo. Khermi lungphun a lan ih Seirah ah a tlan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Seirah a va thlen tikah Israel mi, Efraim tlang parah Israel mi pawl cu ral tho dingin Ehud in tuucangki a phaw ciamco. A cuih tlang ihsin amah rori in a hruai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“I thlun uh; Bawipa Pathian in nan ral Moab mi pawl ih tlunah nehnak a lo pek zo a si,” tiah a ti. Cule Israel mi pawl cun an vun thlun ciamco ih Moab mi pawl Jordan tiva an tan zik zawng ah an va kaih thluh. Mi pakhat hman Jordan tiva an tan man lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cuih ṭum ah a cakzet mi Moab ralkap thawng hra tluk an that. Zohman an luat lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cuih ni ahcun Israel mi pawl in Moab mi pawl cu an neh. Cun Israel ramah kum sawmriat sung daihnak a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ehud hnuah an hotu cu Anath ih fapa Shamgar a si. Shamgar in Filistin mi zaruk caw vuaknak fungzum in a vuak that thluh. Anih khal Israel mi runsuaktu a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ehud a thih hnuah Israel mi pawl cu Bawipa ih hmaiah an sual lala.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Curuangah Bawipa in Hazor khawpi ih a um mi Kanaan siangpahrang Jabin cu Israel a nehter. Siangpahrang Jabin ralkap pawl hotubik cu Zentail pawl ih khawpi Harosheth ih a ummi Sisera a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jabin cun thir rangleng zakua a nei ih Israel mi pawl cu zaangfahnak neilo le ṭha lo zetin kum kul sung a neh-nen hai. Cule Israel mi pawl cu Bawipa hnenah an aihram lala.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Culai ih Israel pawl thu rak ṭhensaktu cu Lappidoth ih nupi nunau profet Deborah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Efraim ih tlangpar ram, Ramah le Bethel karlak ah ungkung pakhat a um ih acuih ungkung hnuai ahcun Deborah cu a to ṭheu ih Israel mi ih thu pawl cu a ṭhensak ṭheu. Israel mi pawl in a cuih hmun ahcun an va fuk ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cule Naftali ram, Kedesh khawpi ih ummi Abinoam ih fapa Barak cu Deborah in a ko ih, “ Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian in, ‘Feh aw la na minung pawl cu Tabor Tlangah hruai hai aw. Naftali le Zebulun hrin pawl sung ihsin ralkap thawng hra la awla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jabin ralkap pawl hotu Sisera cu nangmah do dingah Kishon Tiva ah ka ratpi ding. Rangleeng pawl le ralkap pawl thawn a ra ding naón amah ih tlunih nehnak ka lo pe ding,’ a ti a si,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cutikah Barak in, “Ka hnenih na feh asile na sim vekin ka feh ding; na feh lo ahcun ka feh ve ce lo ding,” tiah Deborah cu a sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cule Deborah in, “A ṭha, ka feh ding; sikhalsehla ral kan neh tikah ziang hman hminthannak na ngah lo ding, ziangahtile Bawipa in Sisera cu nunau kut sungah a pe ding a si,” tiah a ti. Cule Deborah cu a pok ih Kedesh ah Barak thawn an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zebulun le Naftali mi pawl sung ihsin Barak in ralkap thawng hra a lak ih Kedesh ah a fehpi. Deborah khal a feh ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Culai ah Ken mi pa Heber in Kedesh kiang Zanannim ih a ummi sasua kung kiangah a puanthlam a sak. Heber cu Moses farnu ih pasal Hobab ih tefa sin pawl Ken miphun hnen ihsin a cer ih Kedesh kiangah a thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sisera cu Abinoam ih fapa Barak, Tabor Tlang a thleng zo tiah an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cutikah a thir rangleng zakua le a ralkap hmuahhmuah a khawm ih Zentail mi khawpi Harosheth ihsin Kishon Tiva tiang an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cutikah Deborah in Barak hnenah, “Feh aw; tuihsun hi Bawipa in Sisera na kut sungih a thlenter ni a si. Bawipa in a lo hruai a si,” tiah a ti. Cule Barak cu a ralkap thawng hra thawn Tabor Tlang ihsin a vung feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Barak le a ralkap pawl cun an nam ih cu vete cun Sisera le a rangleng le a ralkap pawl hnenah Bawipa in buainak a thlenter. Sisera cu a rangleng ihsin zamrang in a ṭum ih a ke in a tlan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Barak in Sisera ih rangleng pawl le ralkap pawl cu Zentail mi khawpi Harosheth tiang a dawi ih ralkap pakhat hman zuah loin a that ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sisera cu a tlan vivo ih Ken miphun Heber ih nupi Jael ih thlam lam a pan; ziangahtile Hazor khua siangpahrang Jabin le Heber innsang cu an rual-aw zet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cun Jael cu a feh ih Sisera a va hmuak ih a hnenah, “Ra aw, ka bawipa, ka thlam ah ra aw: ziang hman ṭih ding a um lo,” tiah a rak ti. Curuangah Sisera cu a feh ih Jael cun a puanthlam ih puanzar phenah a thup.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cule Sisera in, “Ka ti a haal ih tidai i pe hram aw,” tiah a dil. Jael in saphaw tithawl a ong ih cawhnawi a lakih a pek; a in thluh hnuah a thup sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cun Sisera in, “Thlam kaa ah khan ding awla mi pakhatkhat a rat ih thlam sungah zo tal an um maw ti ih a lo sut asile um hlah, tiah rak ti aw,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cule Sisera cu a bangtuk ruangah ihhmuh thawzet in a it that. Cutikah Jael cun sobul le puanthlam khennak fungzum a lakih a thup tein a peel ih a hnakhang ihsin leilung tiang tlang ko in a khencih. Cunah Sisera cu a thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Barak cu Sisera hawl in a rat tikah Jael in a va hmuak ih a hnenah, “Hinah ra awla na hawl reromi mipa cu ka lo hmuh ding,” tiah a ti. Barak in Jael cu a thlun ih, a lu ihsin fungzum thluah niarniar in leilungah Sisera a rak thih kha a hmuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cuih sunah Israel mi hrangah Bawipa in Kanaan siangpahrang Jabin cu a neh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Israel mi in Siangpahrang Jabin cu an nor deuh deuh ih a neta bik ah an thah.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cuih sunah Deborah le Abinoam ih fapa Barak in hi hla hi an sak:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa cu thangṭhat uh! Israel hotu nasa zetin an ṭang, Israel mi pawl tha tho zetin ral an do ruangah, Bawipa cu thangṭhat uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Maw siangpahrang pawl, ngai uh; Maw uktu pawl, theihnik uh; Bawipa hnenah awnmawi ka tum dingih hla ka sak ding, Bawipa Israel Pathian hnenah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , Seir tlang ihsin na pok ih, Edom ram rawn na pal tikah, Leilung a hnin durdo ih van ihsin ruah a sur; Asi, khawdur ihsin tidai an tla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sinai tlang ih Bawipa hmai ahcun, Tlang pawl an hnin aw; Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian hmai ahcun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Anath ih fapa Shamgar sanah, Jael ih san ahcun, Khual tlawnnak lamzin a ṭhing reprep, A tlawng pawl cun zinte an zawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel khua pawl an ṭhing thluh, Riangvai za in an dai ṭhepṭhep; Israel ih nu a si mi Deborah na thlen hlanah cun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel in khawzing thar pawl a hril tikah, Doral an khua kotka an ra thleng; Israel mi thawng sawmli lakah, Phaw le feipi kengtu pakhat tal an um maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka thinlung Israel ralbawi pawl hnenah a caam ringring; Thinlung tho teih ral a dotu Israel mi hnenah cun. Bawipa cu thangṭhat uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hi thu cu sim ciar uh, Laak raang parih a to mi pawl; Rang todan parih a tomi pawl le, Ke lawngte in a fehtu pawl khal in sim ciar uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngai hnik uh! Tikhur kiangih mipi au thawm cu, Bawipa ih nehnak an aupi a si; Israel miphun ih nehnak cu! Bawipa ih minung pawl cu an khua ihsin an vung feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tho aw, Deborah, tho awla hruai aw; Tho aw, hlasak phah in hruai hai aw. Hmai ah, Abinoam ih fapa Barak, Na kaih mi pawl hruai hai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel mi pawl cu an hotu hnenah an rung; Bawipa ih minung pawl raldo dingin an ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Efraim hrin pawl phairawn an thleng, Benjamin hrin pawl in an run thlun. Makhir ihsin ralbawi pawl, Zebulun in bawi pawl an rung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Issakhar hotu pawl cu Deborah thawn an ra, Asi, Issakhar a ra, Barak thawn, Phairawn ram ahcun an vun thlun. Reuben hrin pawl an cu ṭhen aw, Feh ding thu an relcat thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ziangah so tuukhal pawl dungah an din ringring? An tuu kawhnak ngai dingah maw? Asi, Reuben hrin pawl cu an ṭhenṭhek aw; Tel ve dingah an relsuak thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Gad hrin pawl Jordan khatlam ralah an um, Dan hrin pawl cu ṭilva tlannak ramah an um. Asher hrin pawl cu tifinriat kapah an um, Tikap ahcun an um meen ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Asinain Zebulun le Naftali hrin pawl cu, Sa le ral lakah an nunnak pek an ngam a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Siangpahrang pawl an ra ih ral an do, Megiddo tiva kiang Taanak khua ahcun; Kanaan siangpahrang tla in an do, Asinain sumsaw lon mi an nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Van ih arsi pawl khal in, Van ih an fehnak ihsin, Sisera cu an do ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kishon tiva a lian ih a fen thluh hai, A luang kumkhua mi Kishon cun. Cak sinsin in hmaiah ka nor ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cule rang pawl cu an tlan ciamco, An ketin in leilung an khawn ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Meroz cu siatserh si ko seh, Khawsung mi pawl siatserh si ko seh; Ziangahtile Bawipa bawm dingah an suak lo, Bawipa ih ral an do lo,” tiah Bawipa ih vancungmi in a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jael cu nunau lakah vannei bik a si, Ken mi Heber ih nupi cu; Puanthlam ih a ummi nunau lakah, Jael cu mi sunglawi bik a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Sisera in tidai a dil ih cawhnawi a pek, Kheng mankhung in cawhnawi hlap a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A kehlam kut in puanthlam khennak fungzum a kai, A vorhlam kut in hnaṭuantu-ih sobul a thlir, Sisera ih lu a hnakhang cu a khen, A tlang ih a sop thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Sisera cu a sawn ih a ril, Jael ih ke hram ahcun a ril riai; A ke hram ahcun a sawn ih a ril, A rilhnak hmun ahcun a thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Sisera ih nu cun sangkate in khua a cuan, Tukvirh ong in khawza a thlir; “Ziangah so a rangleng a thlen dah lo? Ziangah so a rang pawl hi an tlai e,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A nunau lakih a fimbik pawl in an sawn, An simmi cu amah in a nolh sal vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“An lon mi thil le sumsaw an zem aw, Ralkap pakhat hrangah fala pakhat maw pahnih maw, Sisera hrangah puan ṭelh mankhung, Siangpahrang nuih hngawng hrangah coihcinmawi puan mankhung,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Curuangah, Maw Bawipa, na ral pawl cu hloral hai seh, Asinain nangmah a lo duhdawtu cu, Zinglam ih a suakmi ni bangtuk in cak hai seh. Cun ram sungah raldaihnak kum sawmli sung a um.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa ih hmaiah Israel mi pawl cu an sual lala curuangah Midian mi pawl ih kut sungah Bawipa in kum sarih sung a umter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Midian mi in Israel mi cu nasa zetih an neh-nen hai ruangah Israel mi cu tlang parih lungpuk, leikua le himnak hmun kipah an relh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel mi in lo an rih tikah Midian mi, Amalek mi le nelrawn miphun pawl an ra ih an ra do ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cu lawng si loin Israel ram sungah buk an sam ih an thlaikho hmuahhmuah cu thlanglam ih a um mi Gaza khua kiangkap tiangin an siatsuah thluh ṭheu. Israel mi pawl cawm awknak hrangah tuu, caw le laak pakhatte hman zuah loin an lonsak thluh ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Minung lawng si loin an ṭilva le an puanthlam pawl thawn an ra cer ih an tamzia cu kharbok zat an si. Anmah le an kalauk pawl cu siar cawk an si lo. Israel ram cu an siatsuah ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Asinain Israel mi pawl cun tuah theimi ziang hman an nei lo ih an caang thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Midian mi pawl in an hrem ruangah Israel mi pawl in Bawipa an ko ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa in an hnenah profet pakhat a run thlah. A cuih profet in Israel ih Bawipa Pathian ih thu cu hiti in an hnenah a sim, “Sal nan tannak Izipt ram ihsin keimah in ka lo suah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Izipt mi pawl le hi ram ih a lo dotu pawl kut sung ihsin ka lo run a si. Nan hmai ihsin nan ral pawl cu ka dawi ih an ram pawl nanmah ka lo pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keimah cu Bawipa nan Pathian ka si ih an ram sungih nan umnak Amor mi ih khawzing pawl nan biak lo pei tiah fiangtein ka lo sim zo. Asinain ka thu nan ngai duh lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cun Bawipa ih vancungmi a ra ih Abiezer hrin Joash ih khua Ofrah an timi khua kiangih sasua kung hnuai ah a to. Cule Joash fapa Gideon cu Midian mi pawl hmuh phan ah a thup-aw ih sabitti sawrnak sungah a thupte in sangvut a ciil rero.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa ih vancungmi cu Gideon hnenah a lang ih, “Nangmah cu mi ralṭha na si ih Bawipa na hnenah a um a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gideon in vancungmi hnenah cun, “Bawipa, thu pakhat ka lo sut hnik pei: Bawipa Pathian kan hnenih a um ngaingai asile ziangah so hi bangtuk thil pawl hi kan parah a thlen? Izipt ram ihsin Bawipa in in suahpi a si, tiih kan pupa pawl ih in simmi Pathian ih tuah mi mangbangza pawl cu atu khui-ah so an si thluh? Bawipa cun in dungtun zo a si. Midian mi pawl ih kut sungah in hlonta a si hi,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in, “Feh awla, na cahnak hmuahhmuah hmang awla Israel mi pawl cu Midian mi kut sungih sin luatter aw. Keimah in ka lo fial a si,” tiah thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cule Gideon in, “Sikhalsehla Bawipa , ziangtinso Israel cu ka luatter thei ding? Manasseh hrin lakah ka sungkhat pawl cu a ṭawnṭai bik an si ih ka sungkhat lakah kei hi farah nautabik ka si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Asinain Bawipa in, “Keimah ih ka lo umpi ruangah na tuah thei ding. Midian mi pawl cu minung pakhat neh tlukin ol zetin na neh thluh ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Gideon in, “Na mithmai ṭha ka co a si ahcun ka hnenih a ṭongtu hi nangmah rori na si ti fiangternak ah thil pakhatkhat ka hnenah langter aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cule na hnenih pek ding laksawng thawinak ka rak ken lai hlan lo hitawk hmun ihsin rak ṭhawn hram hlah aw,” tiah a dil. Cun vancungmi cun, “Na ra kir sal hlan lo ka um ko ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Curuangah Gideon cu a feh ih me thuangte a suang ih bawm sungih sangphut ihsin thilnu tello sang a tuah. A suanmi sa cu a bawm sungah a san, tihang beel in a kengih sasua kung hnuai ih vancungmi hnenah cun a fehpi ih a va pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cutikah vancungmi in, “Sa le sang cu hi lungto parah hin ret awla na kenmi tihang cu a parah toih aw,” tiah a fial. A fial vek cun Gideon in a tuah ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cule Bawipa ih vancungmi in a vun dawh ih a kut in a kenmi funghreu zim in sa le sang cu a vun tawh. Cu vete in lungto ihsin meisa a suak ih sa le sang pawl cu a kang thluh. Cule vancungmi cu a hlo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa ih vancungmi ngaingai a si ti kha Gideon in a thei fiang ih, “Ailaw! Cungnungbik Pathian! Bawipa Pathian ih vancungmi hmaitontein ka hmu ual,” tiah khur phah in a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Asinain Bawipa in, “Phang aw hlah. Hnangamtein um aw. Na thi lo ding,” tiah Gideon cu a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cutawkah Bawipa hnenah Gideon in biakṭheng a don ih, “ Bawipa cu daihnak a si,” tiah hmin a sak. (Biakṭheng a donmi cu Abiezer hrin pawl ih khua Ofrah ah tuihsan tiangin a um lai.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cuih zanah Bawipa in Gideon cu, “Na pa ih cawcang le a dang cawcang kum sarih ti lak aw; Baal khawzing hrangih a donmi na pa ih biakṭheng cu bal awla a kiangih a phunmi thingih tuahmi milem Asherah hi hau aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cule hi tlangmual ahhin Bawipa na Pathian hrangah fekzet le ṭhazet in biakṭheng don aw. Cun a pahnihnak cawcang cu that awla a parah mei-ur thawinakah pek aw; a urnak ah na haumi milem Asherah zanthing kha hmang aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Gideon in hnen-um pahra a hruai ih Bawipa ih a sim bangtuk in a tuah thluh. A sungkhat pawl le khawsung mi ih hmuh a phan ruangah sunah tuah ngam loin zanah a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A thaizing zingpitah khawsung mi pawl an tho ih Baal hrangih biakṭheng le milem Asherah pawl balsiat thluh ih a um kha an hmu. Cuih tlunah cutawkih donmi biakṭheng parih cawcang meisa in urmi tla an hmu fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cutikah, “Zoso hiti in a tuah?” tiah pakhat le pakhat an sut aw. A thuhla an zingzoi vivo ih a neta bikah Joash ih fapa Gideon in a tuah a si, ti kha an thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cule Joash hnenah khawsung mi pawl in, “Na fapa rak suah awla kan that ding. Baal biakṭheng a bal ih a kiangih milem Asherah a hau a si,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cutikah a rak fuktu mi senpi hnenah Joash in, “Baal lam ṭang in maw nan tong? Baal cu nan run ding maw si? Baal a ṭantu hmuahhmuah cu zingthlapit ah thah thluh nan si ding. Baal cu pathian a si ngaingai ahcun a biakṭheng an bal ruangah a mahte in ṭan-aw seh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cuih thok ihsin Gideon cu Jerub-baal tiah an ti, ziangahtile Joash in, “Baal cu amahte in ṭan-aw seh; amah ih biakṭheng a sisi an bal,” a ti ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cule Midian mi, Amalek mi le nelrawn mi pawl hmuahhmuah an khawm-aw ih Jordan Tiva an tan hnuah Jezreel phairawn ah an riak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Bawipa ih thlarau cu Gideon parah nasa zetin a rung thleng. Tuucang ki tawtawrawt a phawt ih Abiezer hrin pawl cu amah thlun dingin a ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Manasseh hrin pawl ih ramsung hmuahhmuah ah mi a thlah ih amah thlun dingin a ko ṭheh. Asher hrin, Zebulun hrin le Naftali hrin pawl hnen khalah mi a thlah ih amah thlun dingin an pan ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Cutikah Gideon in Pathian hnenah, “Israel runtu dingah ka lo hmang duh a si, i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />I hmang duh ngaingai asile sangvut kan ciilnak hmunah tuuhmul ka ret. Thaizing ah tuuhmul par lawnglawng ah daitla a um ih a hnuai leilung a ro a si ahcun Israel mi runtu dingah i hmang duh ngaingai a si, ti ka thei ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A ti vek cun a cang ngaingai. A thaizing zingpitte-ah Gideon cu a tho ih tuuhmul a sawr tikah daitla cu kheng khat a sawr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Cule Gideon in Pathian hnenah, “ Bawipa , na thin heng hram hlah aw. Voikhat tein na hnenah ka ṭong hrih ko pei. Zaangfah tein tuuhmul in hniksaknak ka tuah hrih pei. Tuih ṭum cu tuuhmul sawn hul in leilung ah dai tla sawnseh,” tiah a ti
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Cuih zanah a ti vek cun Bawipa in a tuah thluh. Tuuhmul lawng a hul ih a hnuai ih leilung cu daitla in a ciar ṭheh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Gideon (Jerub Baal) le a milai pawl cu zingpit in an tho ih Harod Cerhti kiangah an riak. An saklam Moreh tlang kiangih hmunrawn ah Midian pawl an riak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in Gideon hnenah, “Midian pawl neh dingah ka hrangih na neihmi ralkap an tamtuk. Keimah hnenih thangṭhatnak si sawn loin anmah ih thazaang ih neh bangin tluangkhawnnak ah an hmang pang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na milai pawl hnenah than awla, ṭihnak a neimi hmuahhmuah cu Gilead tlang ihsin inn ah kir hai seh,” tiah a ti. Cutikah minung thawng kul hluanhnih an kir ih minung thawng hra an taang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in Gideon hnenah, “Na milai an tamtuk lai thotho. Tiva ah vun fehpi awla keimah in ka lo ṭhen sak ding. Na hnenah fehseh, ka timi cu a feh pei. Na hnenah feh hlah seh, ka timi cu a feh lo pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutiin a milai pawl cu Gideon in tiva ah a vun fehpi ih, Bawipa cun, “Uico bangtuk in a lei in tidai a liak ih a intu pawl le khukbil tahrat ih tidai a in tu pawl ṭhen aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An sumpi in tidai a la ih a liaktu cu an zate in zathum an si. A dang pawl hmuahhmuah cu an khuk an bil ih tidai cu an in fingfing.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in, “Ka lo bawm ding ih tidai a liaktu minung zathum thawn Midian mi pawl cu nan neh ding. A dang pawl cu tlung hai seh,” tiah Gideon hnenah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cuhrangah minung zathum siarlo a dang Israel mi hmuahhmuah cu an inn ciarah a tlunter; asinain an lamcaw le an tuucangki tawtawrawt pawl cu an taan thluh. Midian mi pawl ih riahbuk cu an umnak ihsin thuailam horkuam ah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A cuih zan cu Bawipa in Gideon hnenah, “Hmakhatte-ah vung feh awla Midian mi pawl cu an riahnak ah vung nam aw. Ziangahtile na kut sungah nehnak ka lo pe ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sikhalsehla na ṭih a si ahcun na hnen-umpa Purah thawn vung feh hmaisa uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An ṭongmi pawl nan thei pei ih do dingah na ngam ding,” tiah a ti. Curuangah Gideon le a hnen-umpa Purah cu an ral pawl ih umnak kiang tontir ralvennak tiang an vung feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Midian mi, Amalek mi le nelrawn miphun pawl cu acuih kuam ahcun a ramih kipah kharbok bangin an tor; an kalauk an tamzia cu tifinriat kap ih vunnel zat an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cule Gideon cutawkih a vung thlen tikah mipa pakhat in mang a man ih acuih a mang cu a rualpi pakhat hnenih a sim rero lai kha a thei. “Ngaihnik! Ka mangah barli sangvut ih tuahmi sang zawl khat kan riahnak ah hin a rung ril. Kan riahnak ih puanthlam pakhat a run ngah ih acuih puanthlam cu a tlu; a tluk hnuah a linglet-aw ih lei parah a pharh aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cutikah a rualpi cun, “Na mangih tican cu Joash ih fapa, Israel mi Gideon ih ralnam a si; a tican hi thil dang a si hrimhrim lo ding. Midian mi pawl le kan ralkap hmuahhmuah cu Pathian in Gideon kut ah a pek zo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A cuih mang le a tican cu Gideon in a theih tikah khukbil in Bawipa a biak. Cuih hnuah Israel mi pawl ih riahnak ah a feh ih, “Tho uh! Midian ralkap pawl parah Bawipa in nehnak a lo pek ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cule a ralkap zathum pawl cu ṭhen thum ah a ṭhen ih tawtawrawt pakhat fingfing le a sungih meisa van ciami thawl pakhat fingfing a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Midian ralkap pawl riahnak kiang kan thlen tikah keimah i zoh uhla ka tuah mi vekin tuah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Keimah le ka minung pawl in kan tawtawrawt kan tum tikah an riahnak kimvel in nan tawtawrawt nan tum ciar pei ih, ‘ Bawipa hrang le Gideon hrangah,’ tiah napi in nan au pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Gideon le a minung zakhat pawl cu zanṭim hlan deuh ah Midian ralkap pawl riahnak kiang tontir ralvennak an thleng ih riahbuk kiltu ralveng pawl an rak thleng awk pekte a si. Cutikah an tawtawrawt cu an tum ih an kenmi thawl cu an khuai ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />An bu thum in an tawtawrawt cu an tum ih an thawl an khuai. An kehlam kut in meisa an khai ih an vorhlam kut in tawtawrawt an keng. “ Bawipa hrang le Gideon hrangah ralnam!” tiin an au ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />An riahnak kiangih an dinnak hmun ciar ahcun an ding. Cule Midian ralkap pawl cu mangbangin an au phah ih an tlan ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cutiih minung zathum an tawtawrawt an tum rero lai ahcun Midian ralkap pawl cu Bawipa in anmah le anmah a thah awkter. An zaam ih Zererah lamah Beth Shittah tiang, cule Tabbath kiangih Abel Meholah khua tiang an zaam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Naftali miphun, Asher miphun le Manasseh miphun sungin ralkap an ko-aw ih Midian mi pawl cu an dawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cule Gideon in Efraim tlangpar ram hmuahhmuah ah mi a thlah ih, “Rung uhla Midian mi pawl rung do uh. An tlansuak lonak dingah Jordan tiva le tivate dang pawl ihsin Bethbarah tiang rak khan hai uh,” tiah a cah. Efraim mi pawl cu a ko khawm ih Jordan tiva le tiva dang pawl ihsin Bethbarah tiang an khan khelh hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Midian lal pahnih, Oreb le Zeeb, an kai. Oreb Lungto ah Oreb cu an that ih, Zeeb sabitti sawrnak ah Zeeb cu an that. Midian mi pawl cu an dawi vivo; cuih hnuah Oreb le Zeeb ih lu pawl cu Jordan tiva ral ah Gideon hnenah cun an hei keng.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Efraim mi pawl cu Gideon hnenah an ra ih, “Midian mi do dingih na feh tikah ziangah so kannih in sawm ve lo? Zianghman ah in siar lo a si lo maw?” tiah an ti ih nasazet in an phunzai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cutikah Gideon cun, “Nan tuah mi thawn ṭhim tikah kei ka tuah mi cu zianghman a si ual lo. Nannih Efraim mi pawl ih tuahmi thil fate hman cu keimah ih miphun pawl ih tuahmi hmuahhmuah hnakin a thupi sawn a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Midian mi pawl ih lal Oreb le Zeeb tla cu Pathian in nan kut sung rori ah a lo pek a si. Hi pawl thawn ṭhim tlak dingah kei ka tuah mi ziangso a um?” tiah a ti. Cumi an theih tikah an thin a dai sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gideon le a ralkap zathum pawl cu an ra ih Jordan Tiva an tan hnu ah an baangzet naón Midian pawl cu an dawi vivo thotho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sukkoth khua an thlen tikah khawsung mi hnenah, “Midian siangpahrang Zebah le Zalmunna pawl kan dawinakah ka ralkap pawl an baangzet thlang a si. Zaangfah tein ka ralkap pawl hrangah sang in pek hram uh,” tiah Gideon in a dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Asinain Sukkoth khua ih upa pawl cun, “Zebah le Zalmunna pawl na kut sungih um zo vekih na hei rel; ziangah so na ralkap pawl cu sang kan pek sapbai ding! Nan kai hrih ual lo!” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cutikah Gideon in, “A ṭha! Zebah le Zalmunna cu Bawipa in ka hnenih i pek tikah nelrawnih ummi hling le so in nan taksa ka lo hriattlek thluh ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cule Gideon cu Penuel ah a feh ih khawsung mi pawl cu rawl a dil sal; a sinan Sukkoth khuami vek thotho in an rak el.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cutikah an hnenah, “Harhdamteih ka ra kir sal tikah nan ralhruang ka bal thluh leh ding sokhaw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zebah le Zalmunna cu an ralkap pawl thawn Karkor ah an um. Nelrawn miphun ralkap pawl hmuahhmuah sung ihsin thawng hlei nga lawnglawng an taang. Thawng zakhat le thawngkul cu an thi thluh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cule Gideon cu Nobah le Jogbehah ihsin nisuahnak lam ih a ummi deuthlam ih a ummi pawl lamzin in a so ih acuih ralkap pawl ralring loih an um laifangah hmakhatte-ah a nam ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Midian siangpahrang pahnih Zebah le Zalmunna cu an zaam; a sinan Gideon in a dawi ih an pahnih in a kaih. An ralkap pawl cu an ṭekvai thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Joash ih fapa Gideon cu a raldonak ihsin a kir ih Heres Tlangkawn in a feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cule Sukkoth khua tlangval pakhat a kai ih thu a sut. A cuih tlangvalpa cun Sukkoth khua ih lal pawl le khawsung upa sawm sarih le pasarih pawl ih hmin a ngan sak thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cule Gideon cu Sukkoth khua ah a feh ih khawsung mi pawl cu, “In dodal ih in setet kha nan cing lai maw? ‘Zebah le Zalmunna pawl na kut sungih um zo vekih na hei rel! Ziangah so na ralkap pawl cu sang kan pek sapbai ding,’ in rak ti kha! Atu zoh uh, an pahnih in hinah an um,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cule nelrawn ih hling le so pawl cu a lak ngaingai ih Sukkoth khua ih upa pawl hremnak ah a hmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cuih tlunah Penuel khua ih ralhruang cu a bal ṭheh ih khawsung mipa pawl a that.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cule Zebah le Zalmunna cu Gideon in, “Tabor ah nan rak thah mi minung pawl cu zovek so an si?” tiah a sut. Annih in, “Nangmah vek an si. An zate in siangpahrang fapa an bang thluh,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cutikah Gideon in, “Ka unau hlir an si; ka nu ih fapa pawl rori an si. Bawipa ih hminsaal in ka lo sim: Anmah pawl rak that hlah uhla cu ka lo that ve lo ding naón!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cule a fapa upabik Jether hnenah, “Tho awla that hai aw!” tiah a fial. Sikhalsehla Jether cun a nam khal a zuuk lo. Tlangval no a si ruangah a ṭih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cutikah Zebah le Zalmunna in, “Ra awla, nangmah in in ra that hmen. Pacang that dingah cun pacang a ṭul,” tiah an ti. Curuangah Gideon in Zebah le Zalmunna cu a thah ih an kalauk pawl hngawng ih an thlaih mi hlawnthil pawl a lak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cule Israel mi pawl in Gideon cu, “Kan siangpahrang si-aw, nangmah le na fapa le na fapa ih fapa tiangin! Midian mi pawl ih kut sungih sin in run suak a sisi,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Gideon in, “Nanmah ih uktu cu kei ka si lo ding; ka fapa khal a si lo ding. Nanmah ih uktu cu Bawipa a si ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cule an hnenah, “Thil pakhat ka lo dil hai ding: ral pawl hnenih nan lonmi hnakhai pawl kha in pe thei pei maw?” tiah a ti. Midian mi pawl cu nelrawn mi an si ih sui hnakhai an khai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cutikah, “Lungawi aipuang tein kan lo pe ding,” an ti. Puan pakhat an phah ih ral hnen ihsin an lonmi sui hnakhai pawl cu acuih puan parah cun an thlet ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Gideon ih dil mi sui hnakhai pawl cu a zatein pawng sawmruk a rit. Himi sungah an orh mi hlawnthil, ṭhi pawl le Midian siangpahrang pawl ih hrukmi puan mankhung pawl le an kalauk pawl hngawng ih thlaih mi hlawnthil pawl a tel hrih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Gideon cun sui milem a tuah ih a khawpi Ofrah ah a ret. Israel mi an zatein Pathian an dungtun ih acuih khua ah an feh ih milem cu an biak. Gideon le a innsang hrangah cuih milem cu thang siahmi bangtuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cubangtuk in Midian mi pawl cu Israel mi pawl in an neh ih Israel mi hrangah phan ding ral a um nawn lo. Gideon a nun sung, kum sawmli sung cu Israel ram sungah daihnak a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Joash ih fapa Gideon cu a tlung ih amah ih inn ah a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nupi tampi a neih ruangah fapa sawm sarih a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Shekhem khua khal ah nusun pakhat a nei ih acu nu cun fapa pakhat a hrin; a fapa cu Gideon in a hmin ah Abimelek a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Joash ih fapa Gideon cu mi sanṭha zet a si. A thih tikah Abiezer phun pawl ih khua Ofrah ah a pa Joash ih thlaan ah an phum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Gideon a thih hnuah Israel mi pawl in Pathian cu dungtun in an uiret san ih Baal khawzing pawl an biak. Baal-berith cu an khawzing ah an tuah ih an biak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />An kiangkap ral pawl kut sungih sin a runsuaktu Bawipa an Pathian cu an thei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Israel mi hrangah a tuah thei sung thil ṭhahnem zet a tuahtu Gideon innsang par khalah lungawi hna an thiam lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Gideon ih fapa Abimelek cu a nu lamih sungkhat pawl an umnak Shekhem khua ah a va feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A nuih sungkhat pawl hnen ahcun, “Hi khawsung mi pawl hi ‘Gideon fapa minung sawm sarih ih uk nan duh maw? Asilole minung pakhat ih uk nan duh sawn maw?’ tiah sut hnik uh. Keimah cu nanmah ih thi le sa rori ka si tla hi hngilh hlah uh,” tiah ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A nuih sungkhat pawl cun khawsung mi hnenah a ti vek cun an sim. An sungkhat a si ruangah khawsung mi pawl cun Abimelek sawn an hril.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cule Baal-berith biakinn sungih ngun tangka sawm sarih an pek; Abimelek in acuih tangka cun amah thluntu dingah zianghman ih ṭhahnem lo, mi hlothlau pawl minung sawm sarih a saang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cule a pa ih khua Ofrah ah a feh ih a pa Gideon sungsuak rori, a unau sawm sarih cu lungto pakhat parah a that ṭheh. Asinain an nauta bik Jotham cu a rak relh ruangah a luat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cun Shekhem khua le Bethmillo ih khawsung mi pawl cu an khawm aw ih Shekhem khua ih sasua kungah an feh hnuah Abimelek cu siangpahrang ah an canter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A cuih thu cu Jotham in a theih tikah a feh ih Gerizim Tlang zim ah a ding ih a aw neih patawp in, “Maw Shekhem khawsung mi pawl, i rak thei hram uhla, Pathian khal in lo thei hram seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khuahlan laiah thingkung pawl in anmah ih hrangah siangpahrang an rak hril. An zatein olif thingkung cu ‘Kan siangpahrang si aw,’ an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cutikah olif thingkung in, ‘Zanthing dang pawl uktu meen ah khawzing le minung upatnak ih hmanmi ka hriak hi ka taan siang ding maw si?’ a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cun thingkung pawl cun theikung hnenah, ‘Nang kan siangpahrang si aw,’ an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Asinain theikung in hiti in a let, ‘Nanmah pawl uk ding meen ah ka rah thawzet hi ka taan siang ding maw si?’ a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cule thingkung pawl in sabit hri hnenah, ‘Nang tal kan siangpahrang ah cang aw,’ an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cutikah sabit hri in hiti in a ti, ‘Nanmah pawl uk ding meen ah khawzing le milai pawl lungawi tertu ka sabitti kha ka taan siang ding maw si?’ a ti thotho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cuih hnuah zanthing pawl in hlingbur hnenah, ‘Nang tal kan siangpahrang ra cang aw,’ tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cutikah, ‘Nan siangpahrang ih in duh ngaingai a si ahcun ra uhla ka thladem ah ra cawl uh. Nan ra cawl lo asile hlingbur sung ihsin meisa a hung suak ding ih Lebanon ih a ummi sidar zanthing pawl kha a kaang ral thluh ding a si,’ tiah hlingbur cun a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Nan thinlung takte le thinlung thiangte in Abimelek hi siangpahrang ah nan cangter a si maw? Gideon le a innsang parah thil dik kan tuah tiin nan ruat maw? Hnaṭuan ṭha a ṭuan man a ngah tlakmi a ngah tiin nan zum maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ciing ṭha uh; ziangtluk inso ka pa in nan hrangah ral a do! Midian mi pawl ih kut sung ihsin nan luatnak dingah amah ih nunnak hman a ruat lo a si kha!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sikhalsehla tuihsun ah nannih cun a innsang pawl cu an ci in mih nan tum. A fapa sawm sarih cu ni khatah lungto pakhat parah nan that; cuih tlunah a salnu thawn an hrinmi a fapa Abimelek sawn cu nan sungkhat a si ruang men ah Shekhem siangpahrang ah nan tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A ṭha ko; tuihsun ih Gideon le a innsang parih nan tuahmi hi thinlung takte le thinlung thiangte ih nan tuahmi a si ahcun Abimelek parah nan thinlung kim ko uh; amah Abimelek khal nan parah a lung awi ko seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Asinain, cuti a si lo ahcun, Abimelek in meisa suahter sehla Shekhem le Bethmillo minung pawl cu kaang that thluhseh. Shekhem le Bethmillo mi pawl hnen khal in meisa suak sehla Abimelek cu kaang that hram seh,” tiah a au ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Jotham cu a tlan hlo. A unau Abimelek a ṭih ruangah a feh ih Beer ah a va um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Abimelek in Israel cu kum thum sung a uk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cule Shekhem khua mi le Abimelek hua-aw dingah Pathian in rem-awk lonak thinlung a pek ih khawsung mi le Abimelek cu an ral aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hiti a sinak cu Gideon ih fapa sawm sarih pawl a thattu Abimelek par le mi that dingih Abimelek a forhfialtu Shekhem khawsung mi pawl ih parah phulak dingah Pathian ih tuahmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Abimelek bawh dingah Shekhem khua mi pawl in tlangpar ah mi an thlah. An thlah mi pawl cun acuih lamzin a zawhtu hmuahhmuah cu an ram ih Abimelek khal in acuih thu cu a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Culai ah Ebed ih fapa Gaal cu a unau pawl thawn Shekhem khua ah an thleng ih Shekhem khawsung mi pawl cun Gaal cu an rinsanzet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Curuangah an lo ah an feh ih an sabit rah an lo ih sabitti an tuah ih puai an tuah ciamco. Cule an khawzing biakinn ah an feh ih an ei an in hnuah Abimelek cu ṭongsia in an cam an riam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Gaal in, “Ziangah so Abimelek cu kan rian rero? Shekhem khua mi pawl cu ziangce so kan si? Amah cu ziangso a si leem? Gideon ih fapa a si ko lo maw? Amah thu ih a nungmi cu Zebul lawng a si ko lo maw? Ziang hrangah so Abimelek cu kan rian rero ding? Nan cithlahtu Hamor ih minung pawl rian sawnta hmen uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aw, hi miphun ih hotu si ningla ka va duh so! Abimelek hnenah, ‘Na ralkap pawl thawn ra suak uhla kan tawng aw hnik pei cu!’ ka ti ding ih Abimelek cu a van a duaimai ding naón!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cuti ih Gaal ih ṭongka cu Shekhem khua uktu Zebul in a theih tikah a thin a heng ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Curuangah Arumah ah Abimelek hnen ahcun mi a thlah ih, “Ebed ih fapa Gaal le a unau pawl cu Shekhem ah an ra ih khawsung mi pawl nangmah dodal dingin an ra forh rero a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Curuangah na ralkap pawl thawn a zanzan in ra pok uhla hramlak in bawh uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cule thaizing nisuak ah tho in rinlopi-ah Shekhem khua cu nam uh. Gaal le a ralkap pawl in an lo do tikah nasazet in do uh,” tiah a cah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Curuangah Abimelek le a ralkap pawl cu a zanzan in an pok ih bur li in Shekhem khua kiangkap ah an thup-aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Gaal cu khawsung ihsin a feh ih hnarpawn ah a va ding. Cule Abimelek le a ralkap pawl cu an thuh awknak ihsin an suak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Abimelek le a ralkap pawl cu Gaal in a hmuh tikah Zebul hnenah, “Zohhnik, tlang par ihsin mi an run khi!” a ti. Cutikah Zebul cun, “Khikhi cu tlangpar ih phenthlam an si ih, minung ah na neih men a si ko lo maw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Cule Gaal cun, “Zohhnik aw, tlangkawn ihsin minung an run khi; a hrek cu Pol Sasuakung timi lamzin ihsin an run khi!” tiah a ti thotho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Cutikah Zebul cun Gaal hnenah, “Na porh-awk rero sikhawh ziangtinso? Ziangah so Abimelek cu kan rian duh rero ding, a titu cu nangmah na sisi. Himi pawl cu hnihsuahsainak ih na hmanmi pawl an si ko lo maw! Va feh awla va do hnik hmen!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Gaal in Shekhem khawsung mi pawl cu a hruai ih Abimelek cu an va do.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Asinain Abimelek in a neh ih Gaal cu a zaamhlo. A ralkap pawl tampi an thi ih an khua hnarpawn tiang an ruak cu a ril teptep.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Abimelek cu Arumah ah a kir sal; cule Gaal le a unau pawl cu Shekhem khua ah um thei lo dingin Zebul in a dawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A thaisun ah Shekhem khawsung mi pawl cu hramlak ah an feh ih acuih thu cu Abimelek in a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Abimelek cun a ralkap pawl a ko khawm ih hmun thum ah a ṭhen hnuah hramlak in an rak bawh. Khawsung ihsin an suah kha Abimelek in a hmu ih an bawhnak ihsin a suak ih a do.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Abimelek le a homi ralkap bu khat pawl cu zamrangte in hmaiah an nor ih khua kotka sangka ah an ṭang. A dang ralkap bu hnih pawl in an ral pawl cu an do ciamco ih hramlak ahcun an thah ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Cule Abimelek in khawsung mi pawl cu sun nihlawh a do. Cuih khua cu a lak ih khawsung mi pawl a thah ṭheh. An khawpi a balsiat thluh ih leilung cu ci a phulh ruangah ci in a khuh thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />A cuih thu cu Shekhem khua ralhruang ih a ummi khawsung upa pawl in an theih tikah Baal-berith khawzing biakinn ruhkulh sungah an relh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Cutawkih an relh cu Abimelek in a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Curuangah a ralkap pawl thawn Zalmon tlang parah an kai. Hreitlung a lak ih thinghnge a tan ih a liang in a put. A ralkap pawl khal amah vekih tuah thluh dingin thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Cutiin thinghnge cu an khawm fingfing ih Abimelek cu an thlun ih ruhkulh kap ahcun an pen. Meisa in an ur ih Shekhem ruhkulh sungih a ummi hmuahhmuah cu an thi thluh. A thi mi cu nunau mipa an zate in thawngkhat tluk an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Abimelek cu Thebez khua ah a feh ih a kulh thluh hnuah cuih khua cu a lak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />An khawsung ahcun a fek zetmi ralhruang a um ih a sungah cun nunau siseh, mipa siseh, an hotu pawl tiangin an relh thluh. A sunglam in sangka an hren ih inn diphun ah an kai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Cule Abimelek in ralhruang cu a ra do. Ralhruang cu meisa in ur dingah sangka a rak naih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Culai fangah nunau pakhat in tlunlam in fang rialnak lungphengpi in a lu ah a vun thlak ih a luruh a kuai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Cutikah Abimelek cun a hriamnam kengtu tlangvalpa cu zamrang tein a ko ih, “Na ralnam zuuk awla i that aw. Nunau kut in a thi a si, tiih an rel ding ka duh lo,” tiah a ti. Curuangah tlangvalpa cun Abimelek cu a dawt ih a thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Cule Israel ralkap pawl in Abimelek a thih an hmuh tikah an inn ciarah an tlung thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Cuticun a unau sawm sarih a thah ih a pa parih thil sual a tuah mi ruangah Pathian in Abimelek cu a thungrul ve a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Cuvek thotho in an nun sualnak ruangah Shekhem khua mi pawl khal Pathian in a thungrul ve. Gideon ih fapa Jotham in a camsiat vekin an parah a kim ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Dodo ih fapa cu Puah a si; Puah ih fapa cu Tola a si. Cule Abimelek thih hnuah Tola cu Israel luattertu ah a cang. Tola cu Issakhar miphun a si ih Efraim tlangpar ram Shamir khua ih ummi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tola cu kum kul hluanthum sung Israel hotu a ṭuan. A thih tikah Shamir khua ah an phum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tola thih hnuah Gilead ih Jair cu hotu ah a cang. Jair in kum kul hluanhnih sung Israel ih thuṭhentu a ṭuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Fapa sawmthum a nei ih laak sawmthum parih to ṭheu mi an si. Gilead ram sungah khawpi sawmthum an nei ih tuihsan tiangin cuih khua pawl cu Jair ih Puanthlam Khawpi pawl an ti ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jair cu a thi ih Kamon khua ah an phum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel mi pawl cu Bawipa ih hmaiah an sual lala. Baal timi khawzing pawl, Astartes timi khuazing pawl, le Siria ih khawzing pawl, Sidon ih khawzing pawl, Moab ih khawzing pawl, Ammon ih khawzing pawl, le Filistin ih khawzing pawl, an biak. Bawipa Pathian cu an dungtun ih an bia duh nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Curuangah Bawipa cu Israel mi parah a thin a heng ih Filistin mi pawl le Ammon mi pawl a nehter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A cuih kum cun Israel mi pawl an neh ih an hrem. Amor mi pawl an umnak Jordan Tiva ihsin nisuahnak Gilead ram ih a ummi Israel mi hmuahhmuah cu kum hleiriat sung an hrem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cun Amor mi pawl in Judah mi, Benjamin mi le Efraim mi pawl do dingah Jordan tiva an tan. Curuangah Israel mi pawl cu vansaanglam in an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cutikah Israel mi pawl cu Bawipa ih hnenah an ṭap an ai ih, “Kan Pathian, nangmah ih parah kan sual zo; kan lo dungtun ih Baal khawzing pawl kan biak a si,” tiin an ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cule Bawipa cun an hnenah, “A cem zomi tikcu caan sungah Izipt mi, Amor mi, Ammon mi, Filistin mi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sidon mi, Amalek mi le Maon mi pawl in an lo hrem tikah ka hnenah nan ṭap nan ai ringring. Cutikah nanmah run suak loin ka um dah maw si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Asinain kei cu in dungtun ih khawzing dang nan bia thotho; curuangah atu cu ka lo run duh nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Va feh uhla nan hril sawnmi khawzing pawl hnenah va ṭap in va ai uh. Harsatnak nan ton tikah anmah in lo run hai seh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Israel mi pawl cun, “Kan sual tuk zo. Na duh vekin in tuah ko awla zaangfahte in tuihsun ah in run hram aw,” tiah Bawipa cu an dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cutiin hnamdang khawzing an neihmi pawl cu an hlon thluh ih Bawipa cu an biak. Cule Israel mi pawl ih zonzaih tuarnak cu a hmuh tikah Bawipa cu a thin a nuam thei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cun Ammon ralkap pawl cu an khawm-aw ih Gilead ah ṭanhmun an khuar. Israel ralkap pawl khal an khawm-aw ih Mizpah ah ṭanhmun an khuar ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cutikah Gilead mi pawl le an hruaitu pawl cun, “Ammon mi pawl do dingah zoso in hruai ding? In hruaitu cu Gilead mi hmuahhmuah tlunah hotu a si ding,” tiah pakhat le pakhat an sut-aw rero.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Gilead miphun Jefthah cu ralṭha zetmi ralkap pakhat a si. A pa ih hmin cu Gilead a si ih a nu cu hlawhhlang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Gilead le a nupi in fapa tampi an nei ih an fapa pawl cu an hung upat tikah Jefthah hnenah cun, “Kan pa hnen ihsin roco ding zianghman na nei lo; nu dang fapa na si ko lo maw!” tiah an ti ih an hnawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cutikah a unau pawl hnen ihsin Jefthah cu a tlan ih Tob ram ah a um. Cutawk ramih mihlotlau pawl in an thlun vivo ih cu pawl thawn mi an ram vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tikcu a hung rei deuh tikah Ammon mi pawl in Israel mi pawl an do.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutikah Tob ram ihsin ra kir sal dingah Gilead hotu pawl in Jefthah cu an sawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Ra awla nangmah in in ho aw; Ammon mi pawl kan do ding,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cutikah Jefthah in, “Kei cu in hua ih ka pa ih inn ihsin in dawi a sisi. Ziangah so vansaannak nan ton tik lawngah ka hnenah nan rat?” tiah a rak ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Asinain Jefthah hnenah cun, “Cutiih vansaannak kan ton ruangah a si na hnenih kan ratnak cu; kan hnenah ra in Ammon mi do dingah kan lo duhzet a si. Gilead mi hmuahhmuah hi in ra ho hram aw,” tiah an dil ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jefthah in an hnenah, “Nan hnenah ra tahrat in Ammon mi pawl ka do ih Bawipa in nehnak i pek asile keimah in ka lo uk hai ding, nan lung a kim pei maw?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cutikah annih in, “Kan lung a kim. Bawipa kan thutheitu a si,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Curuangah Jefthah cu Gilead hruaitu pawl thawn an feh ih Gilead mi pawl cun anmah uktu le hotu ah an tuah. Cule Mizpah ah Bawipa ih hmaiah Jefthah in an tiamkam awknak hmuahhmuah cu a sim sal thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cule Jefthah in Ammon siangpahrang hnenah palai a thlah ih, “Zianghrangah kan ram in do? Kan parah ziangso lungkim lonak na neih?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cutikah Ammon siangpahrang in Jefthah ih palai hnenah cun, “Izipt ram ihsin Israel mi pawl an suah laiah Arnon Tiva ihsin Jabbok Tiva le Jordan Tiva tiang ka ram an lak a si. Atu-ah cumi cu pontam lotein in pek sal uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cule Jefthah in Ammon siangpahrang hnenah cun palai a thlah sal ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />hiti in thu a let, “Israel mi pawl in Moab ram siseh Ammon ram siseh an lak dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Izipt ram ihsin an suah laiah nelrawn lakin an feh ih Tipi Sen ihsin Kadesh an thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cule Edom siangpahrang hnenah palai an thlah ih a ram sungih feh theinak thu an va dil. Asinain Edom siangpahrang cun a rak siang lo. Cule Moab siangpahrang an dil lala naón anih khal in a rak siang thotho lo. Curuangah Israel mi pawl cu Kadesh ah an umta a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cuih hnuah nelrawn ihsin an feh. Edom ram le Moab ram vel in an feh ih Moab ram ihsin nisuahnak lam, Arnon Tiva khatlam ralah an thleng. Cutawkah an riak naón Arnon Tiva an tan lo; ziangahtile Arnon Tiva cu Moab ram ih ramri a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cule Israel mi pawl cun Amor miphun Heshbon siangpahrang Sihon hnenah palai an thlah ih a ram sung tan tahrat ih an ram ih feh theinak thu an dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sikhalsehla siangpahrang Sihon in a rak siang lo. A ralkap hmuahhmuah a ko khawm ih Jahaz ah ṭanhmun an khuar ih Israel mi an do riangri.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian cun Israel hnenah nehnak a pek ih Sihon le a ralkap pawl cu an neh. Cutawk ram sungih a ummi Amor mi pawl ih ram hmuahhmuah cu Israel mi pawl in an lon ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amor ram thlanglam ih Arnon ihsin saklam ih Jabbok tiang, nisuahnak lamih nelrawn ihsin nitlaknak lamih Jordan tiang, a zatein an luah thluh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Curuangah amah ih mi Israel miphun hrangih Amor mi pawl a dawi hlotu cu Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cumi cu a lak sal na tum maw si? Na khawzing Khemosh ih a lo pek mi hmuahhmuah na co ding hrimhrim a si. Cuvek thotho in Bawipa kan Pathian ih in pekmi hmuahhmuah cu kan co ding hrimhrim a si ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zippor ih fapa, Moab siangpahrang Balak hnakin ka cuang deuh tiah na ruat-aw maw si? Balak in Israel cu a dodal dah lo; a do khal a do ngaingai dah lo. A do dah tiin na ruat maw si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Heshbon khua, Aroer khua le an kiangkap ih khua pawl le Arnon Tiva kapih khua pawl tla Israel mi in kum zathum sung rori an luah a si. Kum hizat sungah ziangah so nan rak lak sal dah lo?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na parah thil ti sualmi zianghman kan nei lo. Nangmah sawn in in do ruangah na mawh a si. Bawipa cu thuṭhentu a si ih tuihsun ahhin Israel mi le Ammon mi karlakah thu a ṭhen ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Asinain Jefthah ih thucah mi cu Ammon siangpahrang cun ziang hmanah a siar lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cule Bawipa ih thlarau cu Jefthah parah a rung thleng. Jefthah cu Gilead le Manasseh ram sung ihsin a feh ih Gilead ram Mizpah ah a thleng. Cutawk ihsin Ammon ah a feh vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cutikah Jefthah in Bawipa hnenah, “Ammon mi pawl parah nehnak i pek a si ahcun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />ka ral nehnak ihsin ka ra kir tikah keimah hmuak dingah ka inn ihsin a suak hmaisa biktu cu mei-ur in thawinakah ka pek ding. Zo a si khalle na hnenah thawinakah ka pek ding,” tiah thu a kam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cubangtuk in Jefthah cun Ammon do dingah tiva cu a tan ih Bawipa in nehnak a pek ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Aroer ihsin Minnith kiangkap tiang, a zate-ah khua kul rori a neh ih Abel Keramin khua tiang Ammon mi pawl cu a that vivo. Mi tam ngaingai an thi ih Ammon mi cu Israel mi in an nehta a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jefthah cu Mizpah an inn ih a tlun tikah a fanu cu khuang tum phah le lam phah in a pa hmuak dingah a ra suak. Hi a fanu cu a fa neihsun a si; fapa dang le fanu dang a nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A fanu a hmuh tikah Jefthah cu a riahsia in a hnipuan a thlek ṭheh ih, “Ai law! Ka fanu! Ka thinlung i kuaiterta ci ee! Ziang hrangah so ka thin nattertu ah nang ngelcel na rak si? Bawipaói hnenah amah ih hminsaal in thukamnak ka tuah zo ih ka pelh thei nawn lo a si!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Cutikah a fanu cun, “Maw ka pa, Bawipaói hnenih thukamnak na tuah zo a si ahcun ka parah tuah dingih na relmi cu tuah ko aw. Na ral Ammon mi pawl ih parah phulaknak Bawipa in a lo pek zo a sisi,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Asinain a pa ih hnenah, “Maw ka pa, hi thil pakhatte hi cu i zaangfah hram aw. Thla hnih sung i thlah awla falat laiih thi dingmi ka si ruangah riahsia ninghang in fing le tlang ah ka rualpi pawl thawn kan lengta ding,” tiah a dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A pa cun, “Feh aw he!” a ti ih thla hnih sung a thlah. A fanu cu falahim ih thi ding a si ruangah cun a rualpi pawl thawn an feh ih riahsia lungleng in fing le tlang ah an tawivak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Thla hnih hnuah a pa hnenah cun a ra kir ih Bawipa hnenih a kamcia vekin a pa cun a tuah. Cuticun falahim in a thita. Cumi cu Israel ram sungah daan hramthawhnak ah a cang ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Gilead mi Jefthah ih fanu zuunngai in kum khatah ni li sung Israel nunau pawl hramlak ah an feh ih an ul ṭheu.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Efraim mi pawl an ko khawm-aw ih Jordan Tiva an tan hnuah Zafon an thleng ih Jefthah hnenah, “Ziangah so Ammon mi pawl do dingih na feh laiah kannih pawl in sawm duh lo? Na inn meisa in kan ur dingih na lu parah meisa a tla ding,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Asinain Jefthah in, “Keimah le ka minung pawl cu Ammon mi pawl thawn thu el awknak nasazet kan neita a si. Cutikah i ra run dingah nanmah pawl ka lo ko naón zohman nan ra lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I ra run dingah zohman nan ra lo ti ka hmuh tikah ka nunnak hman ruat loin ka feh ih Ammon mi pawl cu ka do a si. Bawipa in i zaangfah ih ka neh. Ziangah so atu-ah keimah riangri do dingih nan rat?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cule Jefthah in Gilead mi pawl hmuahhmuah hmun khatah a kawh khawm ih Efraim mi pawl cu an do ih an neh. Ziangahtile Efraim mi pawl in, “Efraim le Manasseh ramih a ummi nannih Gilead mi pawl cu Efraim ihsin mitlanrol pawl nan si ko lo maw,” an ti ringring ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gilead mi pawl in Efraim mi pawl an tlansuak lonak dingah Jordan tiva tan theinak zawn hmuahhmuah in an rak kan khelh. Efraim mi luat tum in khatlam tiva ral fehnak a dil tikah Gilead ralkap pawl in, “Efraim mi na si maw?” tiah an sut. “Efraim mi ka si lo,” a ti ahcun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Shibboleth tiah sal hnik,” an ti ih, feltein sal thiam loin “Sibboleth,” ti ih an sal tikah Gilead ralkap pawl cun an kaih ih cutawk Jordan Tiva tannak ahcun pakhat hnu pakhat an that. Cuih ṭum ah Efraim ralkap thawng sawmli le thawng hnih an thi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gilead mi Jefthah cun Israel thuṭhentu kum ruk sung a ṭuan. A thih tikah Gilead ram amah ih khua ah an phum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jefthah thih hnuah Israel cu Bethlehem khua mi Ibzan in a ho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ibzan in fapa sawmthum le fanu sawmthum a nei. A fanu sawmthum pawl cu hrindang mi pasal a neihter hai ih, a fapa sawmthum hrangah khal hrindang mi nupi a neihter. Ibzan in Israel cu kum sarih sung a ho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A thih tikah Bethlehem khua ah an phum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ibzan thih hnuah Zebulun mi Elon in Israel cu kum hra sung a ho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Elon cu a thi ih Zebulun ram sung Aijalon khua ah an phum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Elon thih hnuah Pirathon khua mi Hillel ih fapa Abdon in Israel cu a ho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Abdon in fapa sawmli le tupa sawmthum a nei ih laak sawm sarih parih a to ṭheu mi an si. Abdon in Israel cu kum riat sung a ho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A thi ih Amalek mi pawl ih tlangpar ram, Efraim ram sungih Pirathon khua ah an phum.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa ih hmaiah Israel mi pawl cu an sual lala ruangah Bawipa in Filistin mi kut hnuai ah a thlenter hai ih kum sawmli sung Filistin pawl in Israel mi an uk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Culai ah Manoah an timi mipa pakhat a um. Amah cu Zorah khua mi a si ih Dan miphun a si. A nupi cu fa nei lo nucing a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa ih vancungmi a nupi hnenah a lang ih a hnenah, “Nang cu nucing na si ih faate na nei lo; sikhalsehla atu thok ihsin nau na keng ding ih fapa na hring ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ralringzet in um awla sabitti le zu in hlah aw; ei thiang lomi rawl khal ei aw hlah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />ziangahtile nau na keng ding ih fapa na nei ding. Cuih na fapa cu a sam na met lo pei, ziangahtile a suah ni ihsin Pathian hnenih pekmi a si ding ih Nazir mi a si ding. Amah cu Filistin kut sung ihsin Israel mi runsuak dingah a thoktu a si ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cutikah zamrangin a feh ih a pasal hnenah, “Pathian ih minung pakhat ka hnenah a ra ih Pathian ih vancungmi bangtuk a si ih ṭihzah tlak ngaingai a si. Khuitawk inso na rat, ti khal ka sut lo; cule anih khal in a hmin i sim ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Asinain, ‘Nau na keng dingih fapa na nei ding,’ tiah i sim. ‘sabitti le zu na in lo pei; ei thianglo rawl khal na ei lo pei, ziangahtile cuih na fapa cu Pathian hnenih pek mi a si ding ih a nun sung hmuahhmuah ah Nazir mi a si ding,’ i ti,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cutikah a pasal Manoah cu Bawipa hnenah thla a cam ih, “Maw Bawipa , in zaangfah hram awla na rak thlahmi na minung cu kan hnenah rak thlah sal awla kan neih dingmi fapa cu ziangtinso kan kilkhawi ding, in ra sim hram seh,” tiah a dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Manoah ih thlacamnak cu Bawipa in a thei ih a vancungmi cu Manoah ih nupi hnenah cun a thlah sal. Culai ah Manoah ih nupi cu lo sungah a to; a hnenah a pasal a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cutikah zamrangte in a pasal hnenah a va tlan ih, “Zohhnik, kan dungih a rami pa cu atu ka hnenah a lang sal a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Manoah cu a tho ih a nupi cu a hei thlun. Mi pa hnenah cun Manoah in, “Ka nupi hnenih a ṭongtu cu nangmah maw na si?” tiah a sut. Cule mi pa in, “Asi, keimah ka si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cutikah Manoah cun, “Cuti asile, na simmi a kim tikah nauhakpa cu ziangtinso a um ding? Ziang so a tuah ding?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cule Bawipa ih vancungmi in, “Ka sim vekih thlun thluh dingah na nupi cu fimkhur zetin um seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sabit hri ihsin a suakmi hmuahhmuah zianghman ei hlah seh. Sabitti siseh, zu siseh a in lo pei ih, ei thianglomi rawl khal a ei lo pei. Ka simmi hmuahhmuah cu a tuah thluh pei,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bawipa ih vancungmi a si, ti thei loin Manoah cun a hnenah, “Feh hrih hram aw hlah. Na hrangah me thuangte kan that ding,” a ti. Sikhalsehla vancungmi in, “Ka um hrih a si khalle na rawl cu ka ei zik lo. Asinain me na that asile meisa ur in Bawipa hnenah thawinak pe aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cutikah Manoah in vancungmi hnenah, “Na simmi hi a kim tikah upat hmaizahnak kan lo pek theinak dingah na hmin in sim aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cule vancungmi cun, “Ziangah so ka hmin theih cu na duh? Ka hmin zohman ih theih ding a si lo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cule Manoah in me thuangte le fang malte a keng ih lungto biakṭheng parah mangbangza in hna a ṭuantu Bawipa hnenah thawinak a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Biakṭheng ihsin meisa a alh ih Manoah le a nupi in an zoh lai fangah mei-alh lakin Bawipa ih vancungmi cu van ih a kai lai kha an hmu. Cu vete in Manoah le a nupi cu leilung ah an bok.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cule vancungmi cu an hmu sal nawn lo. Cutikah Bawipa ih vancungmi a si ti kha Manoah in a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Manoah in, “Pathian kan hmuh ruangah kan thi tengteng ding a si,” tiah a nupi hnenah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Asinain a nupi in, “ Bawipa in in that duh ngaingai sisehla thawinak kan pekmi kha a saang lo ding a si; hi bangtuk thil mangbangza hi in hmuh lo ding a si ih atu vek tikcu ahhin a theih khal in theiter lo ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A nupi cun fapa a run hring ih a hmin ah Samson a sak. Naute cu a ṭhang vivo ih Bawipa in thluasuahnak a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zorah le Eshtaol karlak, Dan ralkap riahbuk ah Samson cu Bawipa ih thlarau in a run ṭhangphawk thok a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Samson cu Timnah khua ah a vung leng ih cutawkah Filistin fala pakhat a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An innih a tlun sal tikah a nu le a pa hnenah, “Timnah khua ah Filistin fala pakhat ka hmu. I biaksak hram uh. Ka ṭhi duh a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Asinain a nu le a pa cun, “Ziangah so serhtan lomi Filistin mi pawl ih nunau cu nupi ah na duh ngelcel? Kan sungkhat le kan miphun pawl lak ahhin na duhmi fala pakhat hman an um lo maw si?” tiah an ti. Asinain Samson in, “In ṭhitsak dingih ka duhmi cu amah pakhat lawng hi a si. Amah lawng ka duhmi a si,” tiah a pa hnenah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Filistin mi pawl do dingah Bawipa in tikcu ṭha a hawl ruangah Bawipa in Samson cu hiti in thil a tuahter a si, ti kha a nu le a pa in an thei lo. Culai ahcun Israel mi uktu cu Filistin mi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Samson cu a nu le a pa thawn Timnah ah an vung feh. Cutawk lampi sabit lo sungih an feh laiah Samson cu kiosa note pakhat in a rak hngirhngir.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa ih thlarau cu Samson parah nasa zetin a thleng ih me note bauhthlek sehla cubangin kiosa cu a kut lawngin a bauhthlek thluh. Cutiih a tuahmi cu a nu le a pa a sim lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cule falanu hnen ahcun a feh ih thu tla an rel tlang ih a lung a kimzet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tikcu malte a rei hnuah acuih fala ṭhi dingah Samson cu a vung feh lala. A feh laiah cun a rak thahmi kiosa ruak zoh dingah lamzin ihsin malte a pial duak ih a zoh tikah kiosa ruak sungah cun khuaibu khat a tizu thawn a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khuaitizu cu a lakih a feh phah in a ei vivo. A nu le a pa hnenah a va thleng ih khuaitizu cu a pek ve. Annih khal in an ei; asinain kiosa ih ruak sung ihsin a lak thu a nu le a pa a sim lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Samson ih pa cu falanu ih inn ahcun a feh ih, culai tlangval pawl ih tuah ṭheu mi daan bangtuk in Samson in puai a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Filistin mi pawl in Samson an hmuh tikah a hnenih um dingah tlangval sawmthum an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cule Samson in an hnen ahcun, “Thu ka lo polh hai ding. Nupi ṭhitnak puai ni sarih sungah ka thupolhmi ih tican in sim thei a si ahcun sunghruk puannemte zun sawmthum le hnipuan thlengnak korfual zun sawmthum ka lo pe hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Asinain in sim thei lo a si ahcun sunghruk puannemte zun sawmthum le hnipuan thlengnak korfual zun sawmthum in pe ding,” tiah a ti. Annih in, “Na thupolh cu in sim hnik-aw he. Kan ngai hnik pei cu,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cutikah Samson cun: “Sa eitu sungin ei ding a suak, A cak sungin a thlummi a suak,” a ti. Ni thum sung a thupolhmi cu an ruat rero naón an thei thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A ni linak ah Samson ih nupi hnenah cun, “A thupolhmi hi na hnenih phuang dingin na pasal hi leem aw. Cutiih na leem lo asile na pa ih inn kan ur pei ih nangmah khal kan lo ur cih ding. Hi puai ih in sawm hi farah thluh hai seh ti in duh ruangah maw a si?” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Curuangah Samson cu a nupi in ṭap phah in a pan ih, “I duh ngaingai lo a si; i hua a si hi! Ka rualpi pawl cu thu na polh ih a tican cu keimah rori hman i sim duh lo hi!” tiah a ti. Samson in a nupi hnenah, “Ruat ve hnik! I hringtu ka nu le ka pa hman ka sim lo. Ziangtin so nang ka lo sim thei ding?” tiah a sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Curuangah ni sarih sung puai a reh lai hlanlo nitinte a pasal cu a ṭah hnawh ringring. Cutiih thlah loih a ngiar tuk ruangah a ni sarihnak ahcun a thupolhmi ih tican cu a nupi hnenah a sim. Cule a nupi cun a rualpi pawl a sim sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Curuangah ni sarihnak ni, a ihnak khaan sungih Samson a luh hlanah, khuasung mi pawl cun, “Khuaitizu hnakin a thlum sawn ziangso a um ding? Kiosa hnakin a caksawn ziangso a um ding?” tiin a thupolhmi cu an let. Cutikah Samson in, “Ka caw late thawn leilet hlah uhla cu, Nan thei lo ding nan ka thupolh mi cu,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cule Bawipa ih thlarau in Samson cu nasa zetin a umpi. Ashkelon ah a vung feh ih cutawk ah minung sawmthum a that ih an hnipuan a lak ṭheh ih a thupolhmi a let theitu pawl cu a pek. Cule a thinheng zetin a pa ih inn ah a tlung sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A nupi cu Samson ih rualpi ṭha bik, a nupi ṭhit lai ih a dinpitu an neihter.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tikcu a hung rei deuh ih sangvut khawm caan a si tikah Samson cu a nupi leng dingah a feh ih me thuangte khal a hrangah a keng. Samson in, “Ka nupi ihnak khaan sungah ka lut duh,” tiah a puzon cu a sim. Asinain a puzon cun a lutter duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A puzon cun, “Ka fanu cu na hua ngaingai a si, tiin ka zum ruangah sokhaw na rualpi pa hnenah ka pek. Asinain, a ngaingai ti ahcun anih hnakin a naunu sokhaw a mawi sawn. Na duh ahcun amah sawn hi ṭhi aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cutikah Samson cun, “Tuihṭum cu Filistin mi parah thil ṭha lo ka tuah khalle mawhthluk ka si lo ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Curuangah a feh ih cinghnia zathum a va kai. Cinghnia cu pahnih pahnih in an mei a ṭem ih an mei karlak ahcun meifar a ṭem cih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Meifar cu a vang ih Filistin mi pawl ih sangvut lo lakah cun cuih cinghnia pawl cu a thlah ciamco. Cuticun an khawm ciami sangvut lawng si loin an lo sungih a um laimi sangvut tiangin a kangter thluh. Olif hmuan pawl khal a kang ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cutikah Filistin mi pawl in, “Hitiih a tuahtu cu zoso a si?” an ti ih Samson a si ti kha an thei. Ziangah cutiin a tuah tile Timnah mi a puzon in a nupi a lon sal ih a rualpi pa hnenah a pek ruangah a si. Curuangah Filistin mi pawl an feh ih cuih nunau nu cu meisa in an ur that ih a pa ih inn khal an ur thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cutikah Samson in, “Hitiin maw nan thil tidaan a si! Siatcam in thu ka lo kam: nan parih phu ka lak hlanlo ka cawl lo ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Curuangah nasazet in a do ih Filistin mi tampi an thi. Cuih hnuah a vung feh ih Etam khaam ih lungpuk sungah a vung um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Filistin mi pawl cu an hung ih Judah ram ah ṭanhmun an khuar ih Lehi khua an nam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cule Judah mi pawl in, “Ziangah so kannih in do?” tiah an sut tikah, Filistin mi pawl in, “Samson kaih kan duh ruangah a si; in tuah vekin kan tuah ve ding,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cutikah Judah mi thawng thum cu Etam khaam ih lungpuk ah an vung feh ih Samson hnen ahcun, “Filistin mi pawl cu kanmah uktu an si hi na thei lo mawsi? Kan parih na thlentermi thil hi zohhnik!” tiah an ti. Samson cun, “Ka parih an tuahmi vekin an parah ka tuah ve a si ko,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cule Judah mi pawl in, “Nangmah lo ṭawnhrem tahrat in Filistin mi pawl hnenih pek dingah kan ra a si,” tiah an ti. Samson cun, “Cuti asile, kanmah cun kan lo that lo ding, tiah siatcam in thu i kam uh,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cutikah annih in, “Asi, a ṭawn lawng kan lo ṭawn pei ih an hnenah kan lo pek ding. Kan lo that hrimhrim lo ding,” tiah thu an kam. Curuangah hridai tharte pahnih in an ṭawn ih khaam ih lungpuk cun an hun suahpi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Samson cu Lehi khua a thlen tikah Filistin mi pawl a hnenah au phah in an ra tlan ciamco. Cutikah Samson cu Bawipa ih thlarau in nasa zetin a umpi ih a baan le a kut ih an ṭawnnak hridai pawl cu olte in a botcat thluh; a ol tukah pat phang khat meisa ih ur cat vekin an cat mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cule laak khaberuh pakhat Samson in a hmuh ih a vun dawh ih a lak hnuah cumi cun Filistin mi thawng khat a vuak that.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cutikah Samson cun, “Laak khaberuh pakhat in milai thawng khat ka that, Laak khaberuh pakhat in miruak a thuah in ka thuah,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cuih hnuah laak khaberuh cu a hlon. Cuih hmun cu Ramath Lehi tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Samson cu a ti a haal ngaingai ih Bawipa a ko ih, “Maw Bawipa , na salpa kei hi ralnehnak tumpi i pe zo. Atu hi tihal in ka thi zik thlang; hiti in mawsi tihal in ka thih ding ih serhtan lo Filistin mi pawl ih kut sung ka thlen ding?” tiah a au.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cutikah Pathian in cutawk Lehi ih leilung sung ihsin kua a ongter ih cutawk ihsin tidai a hung put. A cuih tidai cu Samson in a in ih a tha a kim sal ih a cak sal. Curuangah acuih cirh cu En-Hakkore tiah hmin an sak. Tuihsan tiangin Lehi ah a um lai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Filistin mi in an ram an uk laiah Samson in Israel hotu kum kul sung a ṭuan.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Samson cu Gaza ah a feh ih cutawkah hlawhhlang nu pakhat a hmu ih a hnenah a it.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Gaza khua mi pawl in an khua ih Samson a um kha an theih tikah an kulh ih zanvarte khawpi kulhnak kotka ihsin an bawh. Zanvar zianghman an tuah lo, an dai khepkhep. An thinlung tein, “Khawvang tiang kan bawh pei ih cutikah kan that leh pei,” tiah an ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Asinain Samson cu zanṭim tiang lawng a it. Cun a tho ih khawpi kulhnak kotka khar cu a ṭhuam pawl le a hrolh pawl le a thilri zate thawn a phawi ih a liang parih a suan hnuah tlangpar ram, Hebron khua ihsin ralden ih a ummi tlangpar tiang a phur ih cutawkah a tanta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Samson cun Sorek Phairawn ih a ummi nunau pakhat, a hminah Delilah an timi a ngai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutikah Filistin hotu lal panga pawl Delilah hnen ah an feh ih, “Na tlangvalpa hi a hnik rak del aw; ziangtión so hi tluk lawmmam ih a cak tile, ziangtión so kan neh thei ding ih kan kaih ih kan ṭem thei ding, ti pawl a theih rak zuam hnik aw. Na ti thei asile ngun tangka thawngkhat le zakhat ciar kan lo pe ding,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Curuangah Delilah in Samson hnen ahcun, “Ziangti in so hiti lawmmam ih na cah, i sim hnik aw he. Thuṭhimnak ah midang in a khih le a kaih lo tum bang hai sehla ziangti talin an lo kai thei lo ding maw?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cutikah Samson in, “A caar hrih lomi thalhri thar pasarih in i khit hai sehla ka tha a cem thluh ding ih midang vek thotho ka si ko ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cule Filistin hotu pawl cun a caar hrih lo mi thalhri thar pasarih cu Delilah an pek ih cumicun Samson cu a ṭawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Inn khaan pakhat sungah mi a hrekkhat a ret ih Delilah in, “Samson, Filistin mi an ra!” tiah a au ciamco. Cutikah meisa urmi pat bangtuk in thalhri pawl cu Samson in olte in a botcat. Samson ih cahnak thuthup cu an thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cutikah Delilah cun, “Ruat hnik, thuphan i sim ih capohnak men ah i hman hi! Atu cu ṭhatein i sim thlang aw, ziangtinso mi in an lo ṭemtar thei ding,” tiah Samson cu a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cule Samson cun, “Zohman ih hman dah hrih lomi hrihrual in in ṭem a si ahcun ka tha a cem pei ih midang vek thotho ka si ko ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Curuangah Delilah in hrihrual tharte tampiin a lak ih Samson cu a ṭem hnuah, “Samson, Filistin mi an ra!” tiah a au. Mi a hrekkhat in khatlam khaan sung ihsin an rak bawh. Asinain Samson cun a kut an ṭemnak hrihrual cu pat phang khat vekin a botcat thluh thotho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cutikah Samson hnenah, “Caponak men ah i hmang ih i bum thotho a si. I sim ko aw, ziangtinso an lo ṭem thei ding?” tiah Delilah in a sut. Cule Samson in, “Ka samphiar phiar sarih hi thiam ah tak awla, thiamtleeng in hngette in khawncih awla, cule thiamtlang ah ṭemcih awla, ka tha a cem ding ih mi dang vek thotho ka si ko ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cule Delilah in Samson cu a thlim ih a ihthah lai ah a samphiar phiar sarih cu a lak ih thiam ah a tah; thiamtleeng in hngette in a khawncih, thiamtlang ah a ṭemcih ih, “Samson, Filistin mi an ra!” tiah a au. Samson cu a ṭhang ih a ṭhuam pawl thawn a thiambu pi in a thawhpi luihlo mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Curuangah Delilah cun, “Na thinlung in i duh ngaingai lo naón ziangah so ka lo duh tiah i ti? Voithum tiang rori i hmuhsuam ih ziangruangah so hiti ih na cah, ti hman i sim duh lo,” tiah Samson cu a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nikhat hnu ni khat, “I sim thlang aw he,” tiah Samson cu a ngiar ringring. Cutiin thlah loih a ningcerh tuk ruangah Samson cu a thin a pit ih thih hman a duh sawn thlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cule a netnak ah a thuthup cu a phuan. “Ka sam hi meh dah lomi a si. Ka suah thlak vete in Bawipa hnenih pekmi Nazir mi ka si. Ka sam hi met sisehla ka tha a cem thluh ding ih midang vek ka si ko ding,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cutikah thuhman i sim zo a si, ti kha Delilah in a thei. Filistin hotu pawl hnenah thu a cah ih, “Atu voikhatte cu ra hrih uh. A thuthup i sim zo a si,” tiah a ti. An ra ih tangka khal cu an rak keng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Delilah in Samson cu a cawn parah a thlim, a ihthatter ih mi pakhat a kawh ih Samson ih samphiar phiar sarih cu a hleptan thluh. Cule Delilah in neh hram a thok. Samson ih thazaang cu a cem ih a cah-nak hmuahhmuah a hlo ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cutikah Delilah in, “Samson, Filistin mi pawl an ra!” tiah a au. Samson cu a ṭhang ih, “A hlan vek thotho in ka tho ding ih ka luat ko ding,” tiah a ruat. Bawipa in a fehsan zo kha a thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Filistin mi pawl in an kai ih a mit an phorh ih Gaza ah an vun hruai. Cutawk ahcun dar ih tuahmi hreng an sut. Thawng sungah sangvut an rialter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Asinain a sam cu a cerh vivo sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lungawi ih aih ding le an khawzing Dagon hnenih thawinak nasazet pek dingah Filistin siangpahrang pawl cu hmun khatah an khawm aw ih, “Kan khawzing in kan ral Samson, Kan kut sungah a thlenter zo,” tiah hla an sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Misenpi in Samson an hmuh tikah an khawzing Dagon an thangṭhat ih, “Samson in kan ram cu kan ruak in a khahter, Kan khawzing in kan ral cu kan kut sungah a thlenter,” tiah hla an sak ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Misenpi cu an nuamzet ih, “Samson ko uh, hnihsuah capoh sainak ah kan hmang pei,” tiah an ti. Thawnginn ihsin Samson cu an rak hruai ih hnihsuah capoh sainak ah an hmang. Cule ṭhuam le ṭhuam karlak ah an dinter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A kut kai tahrat in a rak hruaitu nauhakpa hnenah Samson in, “Hi inn ṭhuam pawl i thamter hnik aw, a hngauhsan ka duh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cuih inn sungah nunau le mipa a khat in an um. Filistin siangpahrang panga pawl khal an um ih hnihsuahnak ih an hman rero mi Samson zoh duh ah minung thawng thum tlunta don ah an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cutikah Samson cu thla a cam ih, “Maw Cungnungbik Bawipa , i run thei hram aw. Maw Pathian, nangmah ih zaangfahnak in tuihṭum ṭum khatte hi cu thacahnak i run pe hrih hram awla ka mit pahnih an phorh manah an tlunih phu ka lak theinak dingin i zaangfah hram aw,” tiah Pathian hnenah a dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Samson cun inn dotu sutpi pahnih cu a pom ih kut khat in sutpi pakhat veve a kaih ih a nawp-aw ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Filistin mi pawl thawn thi tlang ko ning law,” tiah au phah in sutpi pahnih cu a tha neih tawp in a tuul ciamco ih innpi cu misenpi le siangpahrang pawl parah cun a vung cim luailo. Samson in cutawk ih a thahmi minung pawl cu a nun sungih a thahmi hmuahhmuah hnakin an tam sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A unau pawl le a sungkhat pawl in a ruak cu an vung lak. A ruak cu an tlunpi ih Zorah le Eshtaol karlak a pa Manoah ih thlaan ah an phum. Samson in kum kul sung Israel hotu a ṭuan.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Efraim tlangpar ramah Mikah an timi mipa pakhat a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Voikhat cu a nu hnenah, “Na ngun tangka thawngkhat le zakhat an ruk laiah a rutu kha na cam ciamco a si. Na cam lai rori ka lo thei a si. Zohhnik, na ngun tangka cu ka hnenah an si. Keimah in ka lak,” tiah a ti. Cutikah a nu in, “ Bawipa in lo thlawsuah hram seh, ka fapa,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cule a fapa in ngun tangka thawngkhat le zakhat cu a nu hnenah a pek sal. Cutikah a nu in, “Ka siatserhnak cu na parih thleng lo dingah hi tangka hi atu ihsin Bawipa hnenah ka pek ih thing ih tuah mi milem le burmi milem tuahnak ah a si pei. Curuangah hi tangka cu atu na hnenah ka lo pek sal a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mikah cun a nuih hnenah tangka cu a khirh sal. A nu in ngun tangka zahnih a lak ih ngunsertu hnenah a pek. Cule ngunsertu cun milem ah a bur ih a tuah. Cule Mikah ih inn ah an ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mikah cu amahte in biaknak inn a nei. Milem pawl a tuah ih puithiam angki ṭaangthlaih khal a tuah. Cule a fapa pawl lakah pakhat cu puithiam ah a ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Culai ahcun Israel ram sungah siangpahrang an um lo ih mikip in an duhduh in an nung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Judah ram Bethlehem khua ah tlangval pakhat a um. Amah cu Judah ramih a ummi Levi miphun a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Voikhat cu khawdang vai dingin Bethlehem khua ihsin a suak. A feh vivo ih Efraim tlangpar ih a um mi Mikah innah cun a thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cutikah Mikah in, “Khuitawk inso na rat?” tiah a sut. Tlangval pa cun, “Judah ram Bethlehem khua ihsin ka ra ih Levi miphun ka si. Umhmun khuarnak ka hawl vivo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cutikah Mikah in, “Ka hnenah hin um aw. Ka hrangah remruattu le puithiam si awla kum khatah ngun tangka fanghra ka lo pek ding. Hnipuan khal ka lo pek ding ih rawl khal ka lo cawm ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Levi tlangval pa cun Mikah hnenih um cu a lung a kim ih a fapa vek rori ah a cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cule Mikah in a puithiam ah a tuah ih a inn ah a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mikah cun, “Levi mi ka puithiam ih ka neih ruangah atu cun Bawipa in i hlawhtlingter ding ti ka thei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Culai ahcun Israel ramah siangpahrang an um lo. Dan miphun pawl cu ram luah ding an hawl rero, ziangahtile culaiah Israel mi lakah ram luah ding an rak co ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Curuangah an hrin sungih innsang hmuahhmuah lak ihsin pacang ṭha bik an timi panga an hril ih Zorah khua le Eshtaol khua karlak ih ram zoh dingah le thlingthla dingah an thlah. An feh ih Efraim tlangpar ram an thleng ih Mikah inn ahcun an riak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cutawkih an um sungah cuih inn ih a ummi tlangval pa cu a aw-thluk in Levi mi a si ti kha an thei thiam. Cutikah amah cu an pan ih, “Hinah zoso a lo hruai? Hinah ziangso na tuah? Ziangah so hinah na um?” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Anih in, “Mikah thawn thukamnak kan nei a si. A puithiam ka ṭuan ih ka hlawhman amah in i pek,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cule annih in, “Kan khualtlawnnak ahhin kan hlawhtling pei maw hlawhtling lo so, Pathian in hun ron sak hnik aw,” tiah an dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cuih Puithiam pa cun, “Hnangamtein va feh uh. Nan fehnak ah Bawipa in a lo kilkhawi a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Curuangah an panga cun an feh ih Laish khua an thleng. Cutawkih a ummi minung pawl kha an zoh tikah lungphannak zianghman nei lo, Sidon mi pawl bangtuk in hnangamzet in an um kha an hmu. Pakhat le pakhat tlunah thunei cuang um loin rualrem zet le tluangtlam zetin an um ih, hlawhsam mi zianghman nei lo ih a nungmi an si. An umnak cu Sidon mi pawl umnak ihsin a hlatzet ih miphun dang thawn pawl awknak le pehzomnak zianghman an nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi panga pawl cu an kir ih Zorah le Eshtaol an thlen tikah an phunpi pawl in an hmuh mi le an tonmi thu cu an rak sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cutikah annih in, “Thok uh, Laish cu kan do ding. Ram cu kan va zoh ih ramṭha ngaingai a si. Ziangah so nan um thuaithi men! Zamrang tein pok uh! Feh lohli uhla an ram cu luah zaang uhsi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A hmun nan thlen tikah helhkam nei lo, ralmuang zetih ummi an si ti kha nan hmu ding. An ram cu a kauzet ih Pathian ih a lo pek zomi ram a si. Milai ih poihai mi thil hmuahhmuah kim ṭhehnak ram a si,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zorah le Eshtaol khua ihsin Dan hrin pawl minung zaruk cu ralthuam kimtein an keng ih an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A so lamah an hung feh ih Judah ram sung Kiriath Jearim ihsin nitlaknak lam ah an riak. Curuangah tuihsan tiangin cutawk hmun cu Dan Riahnak tiah an tita.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cutawk cun an feh sal ih Efraim tlangpar ramih ummi Mikah inn ah an thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cutikah Laish kiangkap hrawngih ram a rak zohtu le a rak thlingthlatu minung panga pawl in an rualpi pawl hnenah, “Hi nan hmuhmi inn pakhat sungah hin puithiam korfual ṭaangthlaih, thing ih tuahmi milem le burmi milem an um, ti hi nan thei maw? Ziangtin so kan ti ding ruat hnik uh?” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Curuangah Levi tlangvalpa umnak Mikah ih inn pan in an pial ih, “Na dam lai maw,” tiah cibai an buk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Culai ahcun raldo dingih a tiar-awmi Dan ralkap zaruk pawl cu kotka kiangah an rak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cutikah thlingthlatu mi panga pawl cu hmakhatte-ah Mikah ih innsung ahcun an lut ih puithiam korfual ṭaangthlaih, thingih tuahmi milem le burmi milem dang pawl cu an lak. Culai ah puithiam pa cu ralkap zaruk pawl thawn kotka ahcun a rak um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi panga pawl in Mikah ih innsung ihsin milem pawl an lak a hmuh tikah puithiam pa in, “Ziang so nan tuah rero?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cutikah annih in, “Daite in um sawn aw! Kam khat hman ṭong hlah! Kan hnenah ra awla kan puithiam le kan remruattu ah ra cang aw. Minung pakhat innsang hrangih puithiam si hnak cun Israel miphun phunkhat pumpi ih puithiam si cu na duh sawn lo maw?” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cumi a theih tikah puithiam pa cu a lung a awizet ih milem pawl cu a lak ih an hnenah a thlun ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cuticun an khua lamah an kir ih an fanau, an ṭilva le an thilri pawl cu an hmaiah an khor vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mikah ih inn ihsin hla nawn an thlen tikah Mikah cun a innhnen pawl cu raldo dingah a ko. Dan ralkap pawl cu an dawi ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />an auh phah vivo. Dan ralkap pawl cu dunglet an hoi ih Mikah an hmuh tikah, “Ziangah so in dawi? Minung kha zatzat ziangah so na run hruai?” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cutikah Mikah in, “Ka puithiam le ka tuahmi milem ka pathian pawl nan lak ih nan rak tlanpi ziar a si. Ziangtiih tuah so in tum? ‘Ziangah so in dawi?’ nan ti ngam lai sapbai!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Dan ralkap pawl cun, “In auh hlah! Um men sawn aw! Hi ralkap pawl an thin na hengter a si ahcun nangmah le na innsang zatein nan thi men ding,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Dan mi pawl cu an feh. An cak tuk ih do ding rual an si lo, ti kha Mikah in a hmuh tikah a inn ah a kir sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Dan mi pawl in Mikah ih tuahmi thil pawl le a puithiam cu an tlanhlo pi. Cule an feh ih mi daizet le mi ralmuang pawl ih khua Laish cu an do. Khawsung mi pawl an that ih an khua cu meisa in an ur.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />An khua cu Sidon khua ihsin a hlazet ih pawlkommi le pehzommi zokhal an neih lo ruangah runtu zohman an nei lo. Laish khua cu Beth Rehoh khua kiang horkuam ih a ummi a si. Dan mi pawl in cuih khua cu an din sal ih cutawkah an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jakob ih fapa an pu Dan ih hmin suangin cuih khua cu Dan tiah hmin an sak sal. Cuih hlan ahcun Laish tiih an rak kawh ringring mi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />An milem cu biak dingah a umnak an tuah sak. Cule Moses ih fapa Gershom ih fapa Jonathan cu Dan mi pawl ih puithiam ah a cang. A tefa pawl khal Dan mi pawl ral ih an kaih thluh hlan tiang puithiam ṭuantu an si ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pathian ih biakinn Shiloh ih a um sung hmuahhmuah Mikah ih milem khal cutawk ah a um ringring.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Culai ahcun Israel mi pawl cu siangpahrang an nei lo. Efraim tlangpar ram dengah Levi pa pakhat a um ih Judah ram Bethlehem khua ih nunau pakhat a nupisun ah a lak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Voikhat cu a pasal parah a thin a heng ih Bethlehem khua a pa ih hnenah khua a tlan. Cutawkah thla li sung a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cule a pasal cu a hnen-um pakhat le a laak pahnih hruai in va leem ih va hruai sal tum in a feh. A nupisun in a pa ih inn ah ṭhatein a rak tlunter. A pa khal in aipuang zetin a rak hmuak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A puzon in a kaih ruangah ni thum sung a caam. A nupisun thawn ti in rawl ei tlang in an riak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cule a ni linak zingah an tho ih feh dingin an tim an tuah. Asinain a puzon cun a maakpa ih hnenah, “Rawl ei hmaisata hrih uh. Nan ril a rawng pang ding. Nuamte in nan feh leh pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Curuangah an pu-tu in an totlang ih an in an ei tlang. Cutikah a puzon cun, “Tuihzan cu riak hrih awla nuamzetin um hrih ko aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Levi pa cu a pok tum thotho; asinain a pu in a kaih ruangah cun a ṭul sal ih zankhat cu a riak sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A ni nganak zingah a tho ih feh dingin a tim a tuah. Asinain a puzon cun, “Rawnhru tal eita awla nuam huahho in um hrih aw. Simneem na feh leh pei cu,” a ti ih an pahnih cun rawl an ei tlang lala.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cun Levi mipa le a nupisun le a hnen-um pa cu an pok. Sikhalsehla a nupisun ih pa cun, “Zohhnik, zanlam a si thlang hi; tuihzan cu riak lawlaw hrih aw. A rei hlanah khua a thim cing ding a si. Curuangah tuihzan cu riak hrih awla um huahho hrih aw. Thaizing ah zingpit tein na tho pei ih na tlung leh pei,” tiah a kaih lala.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Asinain Levi mipa cun zankhat riah hrih cu a duh nawn lo ih a nupisun thawn an laak pahnih cu a todan an dan ih an feh suak. Jebus khua (Jerusalem timi) kiang an thlen tikah khua a thim zik thlang ih hnen-umpa in a bawipa ih hnen ahcun, “Ziangah so tuihzan cu hi Jebus khawpi ahhin kan riah mai lo?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cutikah a bawipa in, “Israel miphun an um lonak khua ahcun kan riak lo ding. Kan lan pei ih Gibeah ah kan feh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ra uh, kan feh hrih pei ih Gibeah ah a si lole Ramah ah kan riak pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Curuangah Jebus khua cu an lan ih an feh. Nitlak zawng ah Benjamin phun ih ram sung Gibeah khua ah an thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cuih khua ih riak dingin zinpi ihsin an vung pial. Levi mipa cu khawsungah a feh ih an mual ah a to. Asinain zan riahnak tlun-inn an tong lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Culaitak fangah cun patarpa pakhat a lo ih hnaṭuannak ihsin a rung tlung. Cupa ih suahsemnak cu Efraim tlangpar ram asinain Gibeah khua ih a rung ummi a si. Gibeah khuami pawl cu Benjamin miphun an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mikhualpa mual ih a to mi cu patarpa in a hmuh tikah, “Khuitawk inso na rat? Khuitawk ah so na feh zik?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cutikah Levi mipa cun, “Judah ram Bethlehem khua ihsin kan ra ih kan umnak Efraim tlangpar ram dengah kan feh ding. Bethlehem ka vung tlawng ih atu cu ka innah ka tlunglam a si. Riahnak dingah khuihman ah tlun-inn kan tong lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kan laak hrangah rawl le hrampi kan nei; ka nupisun le keimah le ka hnen-umpa hrang khalah sang le sabitti lamcaw kan nei a si. Kan ṭul mi hmuahhmuah kan nei thluh,” tiah a sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cutikah patarpa cun, “Hnangam in um awla, ka inn ah rung riak uh. Nan sam mi hmuahhmuah keimah in ka lo pe ding. Hi mual ahcun riak hlah uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cuih hnuah a inn ahcun a fehpi hai ih an laak pawl cu rawl a pek. Mikhual pawl cu an ke an kholh ih zanriah an ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cutiih nuamzet ih an um laifang ahcun khawsungih mi sualral pawl in an inn cu an kulh ih sangka an run den ih inn neitu patarpa cu, “Na inn ih a tlung mipa cu rak suah aw; a sualpi kan duh a si,” tiah an auh ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Asinain patarpa cu lengah a va suak ih, “Unaule uh, a si lo. Cubangtuk a sualmi le thil ṭha lo ningsinza cu tuah hlah uh. Hi pa cu ka mikhual a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />I ngai hnik uh; hinah ka fanu fala le hi pa ih nupisun an um. Atu ka rak suahpi pei ih nan minung an si. Nan duh vek in rak tuah in rak sualpi hai uh. Asinain hi patarpa ih par ahcun a ṭha lomi zianghman tuah hram hlah uh,” tiah a leem ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Sikhalsehla a thu cu an ngai duh hrimhrim lo. Curuangah Levi mipa cun a nupisun cu innleng ah an hnen ahcun a hei suah. Cutikah a nupisun cu an kaihrem ih an sualpi ih zanvar in an hmuhsuam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Zinglam khawfingcat ah nunau nu cu a ra ih patarpa ih inn, a pasal riahnak inn ih sangka kiang a thlen tikah a sawn. Nisuah hnu tiang cutawk ahcun a um lai hrih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A pasal cu zingah a tho ih a innih tlung dingin sangka a hei on tikah a nupisun cu sangka kiangah a kut sangka tlang pawk in a bok kha a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cutikah a pasal in, “Tho aw, kan feh pei,” tiah a ti naón anih cun a sawn nawn lo. Cutikah a pasal cun a ruak cu a lak ih laak parah a suan ih a inn ah a tlung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A inn a thlen tikah innsung ah a vung lut ih namte a lak. Cule a nupisun ih ruak cu ṭhen hleihnih ah a can thluh hnuah Israel ram khuazakip ah a kuat ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cumi a hmutu hmuahhmuah in, “Hi vek thil kan hmu dah keel lo. Israel mi Izipt ram ihsin kan suah ni ih thokin hivek thil hi a um dah lo a si. Ruat hnik uh! Ziangtal kan tuah lo ding maw?” tiah an ti cio.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel miphun pawl, saklam bik Dan ihsin thlanglam bikih Beersheba tiang, le nisuahnak lam ih Gilead ram tiangin, an zatein an suak ih thinlung khat pu in Mizpah ah Bawipa ih hmaiah an tongkhawm thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hitiih Pathian minung pawl a khawmmi lakah Israel miphun pawl ih hotu kimtein an tel thluh. Ke ralkap lawnglawng thawng zali an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel miphun pawl hmuahhmuah Mizpah ah an feh thluh ti kha Benjamin mi pawl in an thei. Cule Israel mi pawl cun, “Na nupisun an thahnak thuhla in sim hnik,” tiah Levi miphun pa cu an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cutikah a nupisun an thah mipa Levi pa cun, “Ka nupisun le keimah cu Benjamin ram sung Gibeah khua ah zan riak dingin kan feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gibeah mi pawl cu an ra ih keimah thah tum in kan riahnak inn cu zan ah an kulh ṭheh. Ka nupisun sawn an sualpi ih a thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cutikah a ruak cu ka phur ih ka can thluh ih Israel ram khuazakip ah ka kuat. Hi khua mi pawl in thil ṭha lo le thil borhhlawh kan parah an tuah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hitawkih a ra suakmi hi Israel mi hlir kan si. Ziangtin so tuah sehla a ṭha ding tiah nan ruat?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cutikah an zatein hmun khat ah an ding ih, “Zohman inn ah kan tlung lo pei. Deu sungih a ummi kan si khalle, inn ngaingai sungih a ummi kan si khalle, kan tlung lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kan tuah dingmi cu hiti in a si pei: Gibeah khua dotu dingah camcawhfung zuk in mi kan hril pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel minung zate ih ṭhen hra ṭhen khat in kan ralkap pawl hrangah rawl kan phur pei. A dang hmuahhmuah cun Israel ram sungih thil borhhlawh an tuah ruangah Gibeah mi pawl kan hrem pei,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cuticun Israel mi hmuahhmuah cu thukhat vua in Gibeah khawpi siim dingah an khawm-aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Israel miphun pawl cun Benjamin miphun ih ram sung khuazakip ah mi an thlah ih, “Ziangtluk thil ṭha loso nan tuahmi hi a si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gibeah khawsung ih mi huatsuak pawl cu kan hnenah rak keng uh; kan that ding ih cuticun Israel ram kan thianfaiter ding,” tiah an ti. Sikhalsehla Israel mi pawl ih ṭongmi cu Benjamin mi pawl in zianghman ah an siar lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cule Benjamin ram sungih khawpi hmuahhmuah in mi tampi Israel do dingin Gibeah khua ah an ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cuih sun lawnglawng ah an khawpi pawl ihsin ralkap thawng kul hluanruk, ralnam keng fetfet, an ko. Cuih tlunah Gibeah khua mi pawl in a hleice ih hrilmi ralkap za sarih an khawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ralkap hizat sung ihsin an hrilce mi kehtlak minung za sarih cu an zatein, lungherhden thiam lamah cun, samphang pakhat hman ṭhelh loih sai thei pawl an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cun Israel mi pawl cun Benjamin mi siar loin raldo thiamzet nam keng ralkap thawng zali an ko khawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Israel mi pawl cu Bethel khua ih Pathian biaknak hmun ah an feh ih Pathian hnenah, “Zohrin inso Benjamin cu a do hmaisa ding?” tiah an ron. Bawipa in, “Judah hrin in do hmaisa hai seh,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Curuangah Israel mi pawl cu a thaizing an tho ih Gibeah khua kiangah an riak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cule Benjamin do dingah an pok ih ralkap pawl cu Gibeah khua ih hmai zawn ah an ṭang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Benjamin ralkap pawl cu khawsung ihsin an ra suak ih an do-aw ih cuih ni ah Israel ralkap thawng kul hluanhnih an that.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel mi pawl cu Bethel ah an hung feh ih Bawipa ih hmaiah zanlam tiang ninghang riahsia in an ṭap. Cule annih in, “Kan unau Benjamin mi do dingah kan feh sal pei maw?” tiah Bawipa an ron sal. Cutikah Bawipa in, “Feh uhla do sal uh,” tiah a ti. Curuangah Israel ralkap pawl cu an tha a tho sal ih an ralkap pawl a hmaisa ih an ṭannak hmun thotho ah an ṭanter sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hihi Benjamin do dingah a voihnihnak an tiar awknak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cule a hmaisa vek thotho in Benjamin ralkap pawl cu Gibeah khawsung ihsin an ra suak ih Israel ralkap raldo thiamzet pawl cu thawng hleiriat an that lala.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cutikah Israel mi hmuahhmuah Bethel ah an hung feh ih ninghang riahsia in an ṭap ciamco. Bawipa ih hmaiah cun zanlam tiang rawl khal ei loin an to. Cule remnak thawinak le meiur thawinak pawl cu Bawipa ih hnenah an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Culai ahcun Pathian Thukam Kuang cu Bethel ah a rak um ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Eleazar ih fapa Finehas in puithiam a ṭuan. Eleazar cu Aaron ih fapa a si. Cun Bawipa hnenah thu an ron sal ih, “Kan unau Benjamin mi pawl do dingah kan pok sal pei maw, a si lole kan baang dingso?” tiah an ti. Cutikah Bawipa in, “Do uh. Thaisun cu anmah nehnak ka lo pe ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Curuangah Israel mi pawl cun Gibeah kiangkap ah ralkap hrekkhat a thupte in an bawhter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cule a ni thumnak ni ah Benjamin do dingah an feh ih a hlan vek thotho in an ralkap pawl cu Gibeah khua ih hmaiah cun an ṭang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Benjamin ralkap pawl cu a hlan vek thotho in an khawsung ihsin an ra suak ih Israel ralkap hrekkhat pawl Bethel lamzin le Gibeah lamzin le hramlak ah an that. An thahmi cu ralkap sawmthum tluk an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Benjamin ralkap pawl cun, “A hlan vek thotho in kan neh ding a sihi,” an ti. Asinain Israel mi pawl cun, “Dunglam ah kan siip vivo pei ih Benjamin ralkap pawl an khua suahsan thluh hai sehla lamzinpi hi run zawh hai seh,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Curuangah Israel ralkap pawl tam sawn cu dunglamah an siip ih Baal-tamar ah an khawm-aw thluh sal. Cule Gibeah khua kiangih a rak thup-awmi ralkap pawl cu an thuh awknak ihsin an ra suak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Israel mi sung ihsin hrilcemi ralkap thawng hra pawl in Gibeah khua cu an nam ciamco ih nasazet in an do-aw. Asinain Benjamin mi pawl cun kan van a duai thlang ding a si, ti an thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Benjamin ralkap pawl parah nehnak cu Bawipa in Israel mi hnenah a pek zo. Curuangah Israel mi pawl in ni khat sungah Benjamin ralkap thawng kul hluannga le zakhat an that.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Cutik lawngah Benjamin mi pawl in kan sung a si ti an thei. Israel mi pawl cun Gibeah kiangkapih a thup awmi an ralkap hrekkhat pawl kha an rinsan ruangah Benjamin ralkap pawl ih hmai ahcun dunglam ah an siip vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hi a thup awmi ralkap pawl cu hmakhatte-ah Gibeah khua sungah an lut ih an ṭhek-aw ih khawsung mi hmuahhmuah cu an that thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Israel mi pawl le a thup awmi an ralkap pawl cu tiam awknak an rak nei. An tiam awknak cu: Gibeah khua sung ihsin meikhu tamzet van ih a kaimi an hmu asile,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Israel mi pawl ral an donak ah dunglam siip nawn loin hmailam ih nor ding an si. Benjamin mi pawl in cutiang ahcun Israel mi sawmthum an that zo ih anmah le anmah cu, “A hlan vek thotho in kan neh a sihi,” an ti aw rero.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Cutikah an tiam-awk cia vek in Gibeah khawsung ihsin meikhu a suak ngualngo kha an hmu. Benjamin ralkap pawl in an dunglam an hei zoh tikah an khua cu a pum tein a kang rero kha an hmu ih an mang a bang ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Cuvete in Israel ralkap pawl cu an her sal ih, an nor ciammam ih, Benjamin ralkap pawl cu an lung hmuah a aa thluh; ziangahtile kan ci in hmit thluh thlang ding a si ti an thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Curuangah dunglamah an siip ih hramlak lamah an tlan. Asinain an tlan suak thei lo. Israel ralkap burpi pawl le khawsung ihsin a ra mi ralkap pawl in an ciipton ih an sat that ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Cutiih an ciipton hnuah an dawi ih Gibeah ihsin nisuahnak lam tiang an dawi vivo ih lamzin tluanah an thah phah vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Benjamin ralkap ṭha bik pawl thawng hleiriat an that.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />A dang pawl cu Rimmon ih Lungpi lamah hramlak ah an tlan. Lam tluanah thawngnga an that. A taanglaimi pawl cu Israel mi pawl in Gidom tiang an dawi ih an saat that phah vivo. Cunah thawnghnih an that.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Azate kom ah, Benjamin ralkap ralṭha zetzet lawnglawng thawng kul hluannga an that.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Asinain minung zaruk cu Rimmond Lungpi lamah hramlak ah an tlan suak ih cutawkah thla li an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Cule Israel mi pawl cu an kir sal ih khawsungah an feh ih mipa siseh, nunau siseh, nauhak le ṭilva tiangin an hmuhmi hmuahhmuah an thah thluh. Cuih kiangkapih khua hmuahhmuah khal an ur thluh fawn.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel mi pawl in Mizpah ah Bawipa ih hnenah thukamnak fekzet pakhat an tuah. An thukam mi cu, “Kanmah lakah zohman in kan fanu pawl cu Benjamin miphun pawl ih ṭhit dingah kan pe lo pei,” ti a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cule Israel mi pawl cu Bethel ah an ra ih, Bawipa ih hmaiah zanlam siim hnu tiang an to ih napi in an ṭap ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An ṭah phah cun, “Maw Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian, ziangah so hivek thil hi kan parih a thlen? Israel miphun lakah hrin khat cu a hlohralta ding hi!” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A thaizing zingpitah Israel mi pawl cu an tho ih cutawkah biakṭheng an dawl. Remnak thawinak pawl le mei-ur thawinak pawl cu Bawipa hnenah an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cule annih in, “Israel miphun pawl sungah Bawipa ih hmai ih pumkhawmnak ah hin a ra suak lomi zo so a um?” tiah an sut-aw. Mizpah ah Bawipa ih hmai ih a ra suak lomi cu thah an si ding, tiah fekzetih thukamnak an rak neih zomi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Asinain an unau Benjamin phun hrangah cun Israel mi pawl cu an riah a sia ngaingai. “Tuihsun ahhin Israel mi pawl in kan phunpi pakhat pumpi in kan hloter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Anmah ih sung ihsin a taangmi pawl hrangah ziangtinso nupi kan holh ding. Kan fanu pawl cu an ṭhit dingah kan pe lo pei tiah Bawipa ih hnenah siat kan serh zo fawn,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cule pakhat le pakhat, “Israel miphun pawl sungin zoso Mizpah ah Bawipa ih hnenah a ra lomi a um?” tiah an sut-aw. Cutikah Gilead ram ih Jabesh ihsin pakhat hman an pumkhawmnak ah an ra lo, ti an thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel mi pawl cu an siar-awk tikah Jabesh ihsin pakhat hman an tel lo ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Curuangah an ralkap lakih ralṭha bik pawl thawng hleihnih an thlah ih, “Hung feh uhla Jabesh khawsung ih a ummi hmuahhmuah nunau le nauhak tiangin hung that thluh uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Fala siar lo mipa siseh nunau an zatein that thluh uh,” tiah thu an pek. Cule an thupekmi vek cun an tuah thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jabesh khawsungah fala note zali an rak um ih cu pawl cu that loin Kanaan ram, an riahnak Shiloh ahcun an run hruai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cule a pumkhawmmi pawl cun Rimmon Lungpi ih a ummi Benjamin mi pawl hnenah cun mi an hei thlah ih ralremnak thu an cah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Benjamin mi pawl cu an ra kir ih Israel mi pawl cun Jabesh khua ihsin that loih an run hruai mi fala pawl cu nupi ah an pek. Asinain fala in an daih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel miphun pawl pumkhat vekih a rak ummi cu Bawipa in a ṭhenṭhek thluh ruangah Israel mi pawl cu Benjamin mi pawl hrangah an riah a sia ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Curuangah a khawmmi hotu pawl cun, “A taang hrih mi Benjamin mipa pawl hrangah ziangtinso nupi kan hawl sak ding? Benjamin miphun ih nunau pawl le thah thluh an si zo fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel miphun phun hleihnih sungih sin phun khat hman hloralta ding cu kan siang lo. Benjamin miphun a nun theinak dingin lamzin kan hawl suak tengteng a ṭul a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Asinain kan fanu pawl an ṭhit ding cu a cang thei fawn lo,” tiah an ti. Ziangahtile, zohman in nan fanu cu Benjamin mi ih nupi dingah nan pe lo pei, tiih siatcam ih thu an rak kam zo ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Annih in, “Shiloh ah Bawipa hrangih kumtin tuah ṭheu mi puai cu rei lote-ah a um thlang ding a si,” an ti. Shiloh khua cu Bethel ihsin saklam ah, Lebonah ihsin thlanglam ah, le Bethel le Shekhem karlak lamzin ihsin nisuahnak lamah a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Israel mi pawl in Benjamin mi pawl hnen ahcun, “Va feh uhla sabit hmuan sungah va relh uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cule rak zoh ṭha uhla hi puai sungah Shiloh khua ih fala pawl an ra ding ih an laam ding a si. Cutikah sabit hmuan sung ihsin suak uhla cuih fala pawl sung ihsin nan duhmi ciar cu an duh lo cingin kai uhla hruaimai uh. Cule nan Benjamin ram ah fehpi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />An pa le an ṭapa pawl kan hnenih an rat ih an lungkim lonak an ra sim a si khalle kannih in, ‘Ngaithiam hai uh; nan fanu pawl cu co ko hai seh. Ziangahtile raldo laiah an nupi dingah kan kaihmi an si lo. Nan lungkim in nan pek mi an si fawn lo. Nan pekmi an si lo ruangah siatcam ih kan thukam mi nan buar fawn lo,’ tiin kan rak sawn ding,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Curuangah an sim vek in Benjamin pawl cun an tuah. A laammi fala pawl sung ihsin an nupi dingah pakhat ciar an kaih ih an tlanpi. Cule an ramah an tlung ih umhmun an khuar ih an khawpi pawl an sak sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Culai ah Israel mi pawl khal cu an ṭiak ih anmah ih hnam le hrin le innsang ciar in an khua le an ram ciar ah an tlung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Culai ah Israel mi pawl in siangpahrang an nei lo. Mi hmuahhmuah in an duhduh in an nung.
  </para>
</usx>
